<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.640" end="00:00:03.800" style="s2">I&#39;m back.</p>
<p begin="00:00:02.120" end="00:00:05.640" style="s2">Whenever I asked my broke roommate to</p>
<p begin="00:00:03.800" end="00:00:08.280" style="s2">use my card and pick up food from the</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.640" end="00:00:11.080" style="s2">deli, I give her half as thanks. Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.280" end="00:00:12.640" style="s2">But today, she suddenly asked, &quot;Serena,</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.080" end="00:00:14.360" style="s2">I&#39;m craving their braised pork trotters</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.640" end="00:00:16.360" style="s2">and drunken crab. Want some, too?&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.360" end="00:00:19.240" style="s2">Hadn&#39;t she cried poverty at lunch and</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.360" end="00:00:21.120" style="s2">said she was completely broke? So, how</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.240" end="00:00:22.080" style="s2">was she paying for this?</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.120" end="00:00:23.960" style="s2">Heck.</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.080" end="00:00:27.560" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll only buy mine.</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.960" end="00:00:27.560" style="s2">I&#39;m off, babe. Take you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.440" end="00:00:33.800" style="s2">$30,000? That deli Samantha mentioned</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.680" end="00:00:36.120" style="s2">spot. It had been open for years,</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.800" end="00:00:38.600" style="s2">serving braised food and drunken crab.</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.120" end="00:00:39.400" style="s2">Great flavor, fresh ingredients, but it</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.600" end="00:00:42.560" style="s2">wasn&#39;t cheap.</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.400" end="00:00:44.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah, get a membership now and save 20%.</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.560" end="00:00:46.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m an only child and a foodie, so I</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.640" end="00:00:49.080" style="s2">impulsively got a membership and loaded</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.720" end="00:00:52.040" style="s2">it with cash. But the shop was far from</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.080" end="00:00:54.040" style="s2">campus and didn&#39;t deliver. Wait, doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.040" end="00:00:56.040" style="s2">Samantha live nearby? I could ask her to</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.040" end="00:00:58.440" style="s2">pick some up on her way home. That would</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.040" end="00:01:00.880" style="s2">work. Thanks, Samantha. Take half the</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.440" end="00:01:02.440" style="s2">food. That&#39;s your payment. And hold on</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.880" end="00:01:04.000" style="s2">to this card for me. We&#39;ll do this</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.440" end="00:01:06.600" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.000" end="00:01:07.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aw, Serena, babe. [music] No problem.</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.600" end="00:01:09.120" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.800" end="00:01:10.400" style="s2">We&#39;re besties.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.120" end="00:01:12.160" style="s2">This is nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.400" end="00:01:14.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy peasy. But I never imagined that</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.160" end="00:01:16.160" style="s2">from then on, charge alerts kept popping</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.280" end="00:01:19.240" style="s2">up on my phone and the amounts kept</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.160" end="00:01:21.840" style="s2">growing. Braised trotters cost $7 each.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.240" end="00:01:24.760" style="s2">Tiny drunken crabs cost $7. Even</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.840" end="00:01:26.400" style="s2">discounted, I rarely got any. Besides,</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.760" end="00:01:28.880" style="s2">her boyfriend was our department&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.400" end="00:01:32.360" style="s2">notorious miser. Together, they lived on</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.880" end="00:01:34.120" style="s2">under $200 a month. It made sense. And I</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.360" end="00:01:36.520" style="s2">remembered she bought clothes on credit</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.120" end="00:01:38.840" style="s2">and ruined her credit. She was overdue.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.520" end="00:01:40.920" style="s2">How could she [music] afford it? Unless</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.840" end="00:01:43.440" style="s2">she used my card.</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.920" end="00:01:46.240" style="s2">Whatever. Call me paranoid, but without</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.440" end="00:01:49.640" style="s2">precautions, I&#39;d go crazy.</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.240" end="00:01:52.080" style="s2">Hi, manager. Cancel my card.</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.640" end="00:01:53.120" style="s2">Manager, cancel my card and refund the</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.080" end="00:01:55.360" style="s2">balance.</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.120" end="00:01:57.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cancel your card? Miss, did our store</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.360" end="00:02:00.132" style="s2">let you down? Tell me. We&#39;ll fix it.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.920" end="00:02:02.652" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not unhappy. I&#39;m worried the card</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.132" end="00:02:04.132" style="s2">isn&#39;t secure. It&#39;s easy to misuse. A</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.652" end="00:02:05.852" style="s2">phone number and name are enough to</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.132" end="00:02:08.012" style="s2">charge it. I don&#39;t trust that.</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.852" end="00:02:09.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, that&#39;s easy to fix. I&#39;ll enable a</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.012" end="00:02:11.372" style="s2">payment verification code, then even</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.852" end="00:02:12.772" style="s2">with the card, they&#39;ll need the code</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.372" end="00:02:15.332" style="s2">from your phone to make a purchase.</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.772" end="00:02:17.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That works. I won&#39;t need a refund, and</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.332" end="00:02:19.892" style="s2">if Samantha hasn&#39;t used my card, her</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.292" end="00:02:23.452" style="s2">pride won&#39;t be hurt. It&#39;s a win-win.</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.892" end="00:02:27.372" style="s2">Okay, [music] let&#39;s do it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.452" end="00:02:27.372" style="s2">Now I can finally sleep easy.</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.376" end="00:02:28.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.812" end="00:02:30.572" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Out again?</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.612" end="00:02:32.572" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Samantha and her boyfriend Zach are out</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.572" end="00:02:34.132" style="s2">on a date. Gone all weekend.</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.572" end="00:02:36.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That dumpy park again? Then a cheap</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.132" end="00:02:38.492" style="s2">motel. Can&#39;t he pick somewhere nice?</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.612" end="00:02:40.212" style="s2">I stayed at that dump once.</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.492" end="00:02:41.812" style="s2">It [music] was full of roaches.</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.212" end="00:02:43.412" style="s2">Gross. Do you think Samantha&#39;s bewitched</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.812" end="00:02:45.252" style="s2">by that cheapskate?</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.412" end="00:02:46.772" style="s2">A motel room is $50, and [music] he</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.252" end="00:02:48.132" style="s2">splits it with her.</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.772" end="00:02:50.812" style="s2">What about Lisa?</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.132" end="00:02:51.611" style="s2">She stayed 3 years.</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.812" end="00:02:51.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No code.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.611" end="00:02:55.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.692" end="00:02:55.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guess I was overthinking it. Bedtime.</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.816" end="00:03:01.652" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.092" end="00:03:01.652" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Samantha?</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.932" end="00:03:05.932" style="s2">Who?</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.372" end="00:03:07.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, babe. It&#39;s Saturday.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.932" end="00:03:07.732" style="s2">Want me to bring back Grace&#39;s snacks to</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.212" end="00:03:10.052" style="s2">campus?</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.732" end="00:03:11.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Samantha, passed the shop this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.052" end="00:03:12.332" style="s2">Hot pigs&#39; feet, and they smelled</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.612" end="00:03:13.652" style="s2">amazing.</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.332" end="00:03:15.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When Samantha used to pick up food for</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.652" end="00:03:17.852" style="s2">me, I&#39;d tell her exactly what to get,</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.732" end="00:03:20.412" style="s2">but the last few times, she started</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.852" end="00:03:21.852" style="s2">adding things I don&#39;t even eat.</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.412" end="00:03:23.532" style="s2">Samantha.</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.852" end="00:03:24.692" style="s2">I only asked for chicken feet and duck</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.532" end="00:03:26.812" style="s2">necks.</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.692" end="00:03:28.372" style="s2">Why all these duck gizzards and guts?</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.812" end="00:03:30.932" style="s2">You know I don&#39;t eat organs.</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.372" end="00:03:33.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh. Maybe the clerk mixed it up.</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.932" end="00:03:34.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pigs&#39; feet and drunken crabs?</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.292" end="00:03:36.052" style="s2">Mistakes, too.</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.692" end="00:03:38.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, those.</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.052" end="00:03:40.772" style="s2">They looked good, so I grabbed some.</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.452" end="00:03:41.612" style="s2">Won&#39;t happen again.</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.772" end="00:03:43.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.612" end="00:03:45.372" style="s2">she be adding her pigs&#39; feet and drunken</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.492" end="00:03:47.852" style="s2">crabs to my order for chicken feet and</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.372" end="00:03:49.292" style="s2">duck necks? No, Samantha.</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.852" end="00:03:51.692" style="s2">I&#39;m going to the food market with Zoe</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.292" end="00:03:53.532" style="s2">today. I won&#39;t have room for that.</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.692" end="00:03:55.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s different. Street food can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.532" end="00:03:57.612" style="s2">compare to that old shop. Besides, don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.812" end="00:03:59.572" style="s2">you miss it after a week? When I head</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.612" end="00:04:01.932" style="s2">back, I&#39;ll bring you some. No, I mean</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.572" end="00:04:01.932" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.414" end="00:04:09.974" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it, babe? Change your mind?</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.734" end="00:04:12.214" style="s2">What do you want? I&#39;m going now. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.974" end="00:04:13.814" style="s2">want any today. Don&#39;t bring any. It&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.214" end="00:04:16.494" style="s2">go to waste, and I&#39;ll get mad.</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.814" end="00:04:18.374" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, fine. I won&#39;t get you any. Why so</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.494" end="00:04:20.414" style="s2">serious?</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.374" end="00:04:22.374" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ready, babe? You said you&#39;re treating,</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.414" end="00:04:24.094" style="s2">right?</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.374" end="00:04:27.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why does that guy sound so much like her</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.094" end="00:04:30.254" style="s2">boyfriend, Zach? Weird. Isn&#39;t bus fare a</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.694" end="00:04:33.374" style="s2">waste of money to him? He never takes</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.254" end="00:04:35.054" style="s2">Samantha home. Why is he near her house?</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.374" end="00:04:36.414" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me she took Zach to this</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.054" end="00:04:38.174" style="s2">restaurant.</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.414" end="00:04:40.414" style="s2">Don&#39;t be silly.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.174" end="00:04:42.694" style="s2">Maybe Samantha got more cash from home,</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.414" end="00:04:44.734" style="s2">or borrowed some to tide her over. My</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.694" end="00:04:47.214" style="s2">membership card is locked now, so I</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.734" end="00:04:50.014" style="s2">should stop overthinking. Bestie, come</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.214" end="00:04:50.014" style="s2">shopping with me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.374" end="00:04:54.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, your roommate&#39;s generous. That</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.774" end="00:04:55.454" style="s2">place they&#39;re eating at, isn&#39;t it your</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.614" end="00:04:57.054" style="s2">usual deli?</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.454" end="00:04:58.134" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks for my birthday feast, sugar</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.054" end="00:04:59.534" style="s2">mama.</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.134" end="00:05:00.534" style="s2">The whole dorm and their partners</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.534" end="00:05:03.174" style="s2">&gt;&gt; all feasting together.</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.534" end="00:05:05.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;d Samantha get all that?</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.174" end="00:05:08.094" style="s2">Good thing I got no verification code or</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.654" end="00:05:09.934" style="s2">purchase alert. She probably didn&#39;t use</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.094" end="00:05:11.654" style="s2">my membership card.</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.934" end="00:05:13.934" style="s2">Guess I was being petty.</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.654" end="00:05:15.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, well, isn&#39;t that the department&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.934" end="00:05:16.774" style="s2">famous cheapskate?</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.654" end="00:05:18.894" style="s2">You spent money today?</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.774" end="00:05:21.254" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This place is really good, but it isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.894" end="00:05:21.894" style="s2">cheap. Knowing Zach, there&#39;s no way he</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.254" end="00:05:23.854" style="s2">paid.</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.894" end="00:05:26.974" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A local classic, great food, and worth</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.854" end="00:05:28.414" style="s2">the price. This meal was under $150, and</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.974" end="00:05:28.934" style="s2">the whole tab was covered by my sweet</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.414" end="00:05:29.654" style="s2">wife.</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.934" end="00:05:31.134" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh,</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.654" end="00:05:32.774" style="s2">sugar mama and daddy. Ballers.</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.134" end="00:05:35.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zach&#39;s at it again, showing off in the</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.774" end="00:05:37.014" style="s2">comments. Now he&#39;s playing rich kid,</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.214" end="00:05:37.734" style="s2">like Samantha paying means he paid for</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.014" end="00:05:38.174" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.734" end="00:05:40.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CSK.</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.174" end="00:05:42.974" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, he just said Samantha paid for all</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.894" end="00:05:44.934" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.974" end="00:05:46.974" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Samantha, when we treat everyone, it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.934" end="00:05:48.934" style="s2">hot pot or barbecue. This is a college</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.974" end="00:05:49.534" style="s2">town. Food&#39;s cheap here. Why go</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.934" end="00:05:51.574" style="s2">overboard?</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.534" end="00:05:54.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. You only ever treat us to</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.574" end="00:05:55.694" style="s2">cafeteria hot pot and snail noodles. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.014" end="00:05:58.294" style="s2">sick of them. You know how tiny my</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.694" end="00:06:00.454" style="s2">allowance is. It&#39;s never enough. Next</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.294" end="00:06:00.494" style="s2">time, I&#39;ll treat you to a big</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.454" end="00:06:02.574" style="s2">&gt;&gt; meal.</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.494" end="00:06:05.175" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We knew money was tight for her. Dating</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.574" end="00:06:07.455" style="s2">isn&#39;t cheap, either. For 3 years, we let</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.175" end="00:06:09.895" style="s2">it slide, but this time, why is she</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.455" end="00:06:11.775" style="s2">suddenly splurging? Could it be because</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.895" end="00:06:14.255" style="s2">Zach can&#39;t treat his roomies, so she</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.775" end="00:06:16.215" style="s2">must cover for him? Serena, small world.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.255" end="00:06:18.055" style="s2">Getting bubble tea, too?</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.215" end="00:06:19.895" style="s2">Serena, did you see? Samantha is a</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.055" end="00:06:22.695" style="s2">hypocrite. She bought Zach&#39;s roommates a</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.895" end="00:06:24.615" style="s2">nearly $150 meal. So generous. Her</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.695" end="00:06:27.055" style="s2">boyfriend comes first.</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.615" end="00:06:29.255" style="s2">Serena, you&#39;ve been so good to her.</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.055" end="00:06:30.455" style="s2">Yet, she didn&#39;t invite you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.255" end="00:06:32.735" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.455" end="00:06:35.015" style="s2">My turn next. I&#39;ll buy Samantha spicy</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.735" end="00:06:37.295" style="s2">hot pot. Don&#39;t call me cheap. For 3</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.015" end="00:06:38.775" style="s2">years, I thought she was broke, so I let</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.295" end="00:06:41.015" style="s2">it slide. [music] Who knew she&#39;d turn</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.775" end="00:06:42.535" style="s2">around and spend big? Right.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.015" end="00:06:43.975" style="s2">Just yesterday, she pretended she</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.535" end="00:06:45.575" style="s2">couldn&#39;t afford food and tried to borrow</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.975" end="00:06:48.135" style="s2">$30 from me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.575" end="00:06:50.095" style="s2">She still owes me the last $45. So,</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.135" end="00:06:52.615" style="s2">that&#39;s how she could afford this. She</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.095" end="00:06:54.855" style="s2">borrowed money to show off. Whatever,</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.615" end="00:06:57.615" style="s2">it&#39;s not my money. Her showing off isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.855" end="00:06:57.615" style="s2">my problem.</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.855" end="00:07:02.135" style="s2">Dear valued Deli member, your purchase</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.015" end="00:07:04.495" style="s2">total is $30,000.</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.135" end="00:07:06.735" style="s2">Thank you for your business.</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.495" end="00:07:09.615" style="s2">I&#39;m sitting here drinking boba.</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.735" end="00:07:10.895" style="s2">When did I spend another $30,000?</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.615" end="00:07:12.215" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.895" end="00:07:13.895" style="s2">Samantha.</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.215" end="00:07:15.895" style="s2">Samantha&#39;s treating everyone, and this</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.895" end="00:07:17.935" style="s2">sucker&#39;s putting the bill? But, I sent a</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.895" end="00:07:21.055" style="s2">verification code.</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.935" end="00:07:21.055" style="s2">How&#39;d the charge [music] go through?</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.295" end="00:07:28.615" style="s2">It wasn&#39;t [music] a charge.</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.055" end="00:07:29.815" style="s2">It was a verification code.</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.615" end="00:07:32.215" style="s2">Serena.</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.815" end="00:07:34.655" style="s2">You laughed, then rolled your eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.215" end="00:07:35.935" style="s2">What&#39;s going on? Now I know how Samantha</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.655" end="00:07:37.975" style="s2">always has [music] money to treat</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.935" end="00:07:39.975" style="s2">everyone. Sam.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.975" end="00:07:41.375" style="s2">She&#39;s got some nerve.</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.975" end="00:07:43.055" style="s2">Who uses someone else&#39;s [music] card</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.375" end="00:07:45.615" style="s2">like it&#39;s their own, then treats the</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.055" end="00:07:47.735" style="s2">whole crowd with it? Shameless.</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.615" end="00:07:49.335" style="s2">Voicemail. If I hadn&#39;t locked my rewards</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.735" end="00:07:51.935" style="s2">card last night,</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.335" end="00:07:53.055" style="s2">I&#39;d be the one in trouble right now.</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.935" end="00:07:54.175" style="s2">Tinkles.</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.055" end="00:07:56.655" style="s2">Still calling.</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.175" end="00:07:59.015" style="s2">She really won&#39;t quit till the end.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.655" end="00:08:00.175" style="s2">Serena, pick up. [music] I need you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.015" end="00:08:02.855" style="s2">It&#39;s urgent.</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.175" end="00:08:05.455" style="s2">Seriously urgent. Please, pick up. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.855" end="00:08:07.657" style="s2">an emergency. Can anyone find Serena?</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.455" end="00:08:10.257" style="s2">Urgent, urgent, urgent. Is Serena with</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.657" end="00:08:12.217" style="s2">Zoe? Anyone have Zoe&#39;s number? Urgent.</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.257" end="00:08:14.657" style="s2">This is life or death. Please help me</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.217" end="00:08:17.577" style="s2">find her. Tell her to call me now.</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.657" end="00:08:19.257" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one replied. Total radio silence. Uh,</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.577" end="00:08:21.737" style="s2">your roommate texted you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.257" end="00:08:24.537" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, Samantha called asking for you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.737" end="00:08:26.320" style="s2">What&#39;s going on? I haven&#39;t replied. What</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.537" end="00:08:28.617" style="s2">happened? Samantha used my card to treat</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.320" end="00:08:31.817" style="s2">[music] everyone. She tried to freeload,</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.617" end="00:08:31.817" style="s2">failed, ignore her.</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.577" end="00:08:35.097" style="s2">Look.</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.800" end="00:08:39.457" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.457" end="00:08:42.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Samantha&#39;s number.</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.457" end="00:08:45.137" style="s2">How did she get your phone number?</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.857" end="00:08:46.177" style="s2">Hi.</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.137" end="00:08:48.537" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey,</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.177" end="00:08:51.257" style="s2">Serena&#39;s friend, right? I&#39;m her roommate</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.537" end="00:08:53.737" style="s2">Samantha&#39;s boyfriend, Zach. Serena won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.257" end="00:08:55.057" style="s2">pick up. Tell her to send the code now.</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.737" end="00:08:57.417" style="s2">Quit wasting time.</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.057" end="00:08:58.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A code? What code? Do I know you? And</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.417" end="00:09:00.657" style="s2">you&#39;re asking my friend for a code.</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.857" end="00:09:02.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you two are together.</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.657" end="00:09:03.697" style="s2">The code her phone just got. It&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.417" end="00:09:05.817" style="s2">digits. Hurry up.</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.697" end="00:09:07.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Big talk for a nobody.</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.817" end="00:09:09.857" style="s2">Do I know you? You called demanding a</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.617" end="00:09:12.417" style="s2">code. Are you some phone scammer?</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.857" end="00:09:13.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What scam? This is Samantha&#39;s number.</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.417" end="00:09:14.697" style="s2">Put her on.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.217" end="00:09:16.257" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s Samantha?</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.697" end="00:09:18.017" style="s2">Never heard of her.</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.257" end="00:09:20.017" style="s2">Besides, why would your code go to my</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.017" end="00:09:21.057" style="s2">friend&#39;s phone? Then you come asking us</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.017" end="00:09:22.177" style="s2">for it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.057" end="00:09:23.897" style="s2">Who do you think you are?</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.177" end="00:09:25.377" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They sent it wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.897" end="00:09:27.297" style="s2">We&#39;re roommates. What&#39;s wrong with</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.377" end="00:09:29.097" style="s2">helping? Why be so petty?</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.297" end="00:09:30.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen, I have an anti-scam app on my</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.097" end="00:09:31.457" style="s2">phone.</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.097" end="00:09:33.737" style="s2">I know this trick.</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.457" end="00:09:35.537" style="s2">All you say is code, code.</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.737" end="00:09:38.057" style="s2">How do I know you&#39;re not a scammer?</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.537" end="00:09:39.977" style="s2">Call again and I&#39;m calling the cops.</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.057" end="00:09:40.457" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s this mad woman? She called me a</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.977" end="00:09:41.417" style="s2">scammer.</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.457" end="00:09:44.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay,</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.417" end="00:09:46.297" style="s2">I&#39;ll try calling Serena.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.217" end="00:09:48.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t answer. Let them sweat.</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.297" end="00:09:53.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, they always saw me as an easy mark</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.897" end="00:09:53.857" style="s2">to exploit. This time I strike back.</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.217" end="00:10:01.417" style="s2">That Serena acts so generous but flakes</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.297" end="00:10:02.497" style="s2">when it counts. It&#39;s just a verification</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.417" end="00:10:04.297" style="s2">code.</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.497" end="00:10:05.937" style="s2">Why take so long to answer?</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.297" end="00:10:08.057" style="s2">What&#39;s her problem?</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.937" end="00:10:09.777" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, you that roommate of yours is all</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.057" end="00:10:11.578" style="s2">for show. She buys you snacks a few</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.777" end="00:10:13.458" style="s2">times, then takes advantage by making</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.578" end="00:10:14.298" style="s2">you pick hers up every time. She&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.458" end="00:10:15.738" style="s2">worth knowing.</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.298" end="00:10:18.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she really minded, she could have</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.738" end="00:10:19.978" style="s2">just said so. Why demand a code out of</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.018" end="00:10:22.018" style="s2">nowhere? What&#39;s that about? [music] I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.978" end="00:10:24.498" style="s2">run so many errands for her. That should</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.018" end="00:10:26.378" style="s2">count for something. But no, she turns</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.498" end="00:10:28.338" style="s2">on me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.378" end="00:10:29.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A born spoiled princess</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.338" end="00:10:31.138" style="s2">needs fixing.</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.698" end="00:10:31.538" style="s2">Does she think the world revolves around</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.138" end="00:10:34.098" style="s2">her?</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.538" end="00:10:34.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right.</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.738" end="00:10:39.778" style="s2">Serena. Serena. When did you answer?</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.458" end="00:10:41.818" style="s2">Why didn&#39;t you catch it?</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.778" end="00:10:43.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t notice.</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.818" end="00:10:46.578" style="s2">Did she hear all that?</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.098" end="00:10:48.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just answered. What&#39;s up?</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.578" end="00:10:50.818" style="s2">Serena, I bought something online a few</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.498" end="00:10:52.138" style="s2">days ago. I feared mom would get mad, so</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.818" end="00:10:54.618" style="s2">I gave them your number. I need the</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.138" end="00:10:56.578" style="s2">delivery code. Check your texts. Just</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.618" end="00:10:59.058" style="s2">give me the code. Please. She still</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.578" end="00:11:00.538" style="s2">thinks she can fool me. A delivery code?</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.058" end="00:11:02.618" style="s2">Does she think I&#39;m stupid? We were</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.538" end="00:11:04.818" style="s2">roommates. I&#39;d be lying if I said I</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.618" end="00:11:07.338" style="s2">didn&#39;t care. And she did run errands for</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.818" end="00:11:10.218" style="s2">me. I&#39;ll give her one last chance.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.338" end="00:11:12.058" style="s2">Samantha, about those texts. I keep</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.218" end="00:11:14.298" style="s2">getting charge alerts from that deli.</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.058" end="00:11:16.138" style="s2">Some for tens, some hundreds. Some</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.298" end="00:11:19.458" style="s2">aren&#39;t even my orders. You pick [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.138" end="00:11:20.658" style="s2">up for me a lot. Do you know why?</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.458" end="00:11:21.858" style="s2">That charge.</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.658" end="00:11:24.778" style="s2">How would I know?</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.858" end="00:11:26.978" style="s2">You spent it. Why ask me where it went?</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.778" end="00:11:28.018" style="s2">Did you forget? You ate it and now you</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.978" end="00:11:29.698" style="s2">deny it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.018" end="00:11:32.218" style="s2">Serena, forget that.</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.698" end="00:11:34.858" style="s2">Just send me the verification code.</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.218" end="00:11:35.858" style="s2">Still won&#39;t admit it? Samantha, I gave</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.858" end="00:11:38.418" style="s2">you a chance.</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.858" end="00:11:39.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, what will you do? Don&#39;t let this</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.418" end="00:11:41.058" style="s2">slide.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.018" end="00:11:44.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She wants to treat them on my card? Let</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.058" end="00:11:46.058" style="s2">her. The more the better. Girl, Samantha</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.418" end="00:11:48.818" style="s2">treated them on my card and spent</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.058" end="00:11:50.938" style="s2">$4,000. She thought I didn&#39;t know. I</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.818" end="00:11:53.378" style="s2">gave her a chance. She denied it and</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.938" end="00:11:55.298" style="s2">trashed me behind my back. From now on,</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.378" end="00:11:56.698" style="s2">whatever she says, don&#39;t engage with</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.298" end="00:11:59.378" style="s2">her. Don&#39;t reply at all.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.698" end="00:12:00.508" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it. Cut that ungrateful wretch off.</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.378" end="00:12:00.658" style="s2">I won&#39;t reply.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.508" end="00:12:03.178" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.658" end="00:12:04.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s gross. Never liked her. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.178" end="00:12:06.258" style="s2">teach her a lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.098" end="00:12:08.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, is your signal bad? We can</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.258" end="00:12:11.018" style="s2">message online. Send the code, quick.</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.938" end="00:12:13.099" style="s2">The delivery guy can&#39;t wait. When I get</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.018" end="00:12:13.579" style="s2">back to campus, I&#39;ll bring the braised</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.099" end="00:12:15.179" style="s2">pork.</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.579" end="00:12:17.419" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;d never guess you saw through her</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.179" end="00:12:18.579" style="s2">scheme. She thinks she can still fool</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.419" end="00:12:21.059" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.579" end="00:12:22.459" style="s2">She thinks Serena, our top student, is</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.059" end="00:12:24.619" style="s2">some clueless fool.</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.459" end="00:12:26.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s used to my kindness. She thinks I</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.619" end="00:12:28.779" style="s2">miss her sneaking extras.</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.939" end="00:12:31.019" style="s2">She&#39;d secretly use my card to buy</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.779" end="00:12:33.699" style="s2">whatever she wanted. I used to let it</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.019" end="00:12:35.379" style="s2">slide, but now I&#39;ll make her pay back</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.699" end="00:12:38.379" style="s2">every cent.</p>
<p begin="00:12:35.379" end="00:12:42.179" style="s2">Samantha, my signal was bad. I got the</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.379" end="00:12:44.459" style="s2">code. If you want it, I can send it.</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.179" end="00:12:46.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, what are you thinking?</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.459" end="00:12:49.579" style="s2">You&#39;re practically handing them money.</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.259" end="00:12:51.019" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. I&#39;ve set the stage. Now we wait</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.579" end="00:12:53.379" style="s2">for them to put on a show.</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.019" end="00:12:54.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zack, we&#39;ve waited all day.</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.379" end="00:12:56.739" style="s2">The bill&#39;s still unpaid.</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.699" end="00:12:57.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will you pay or not? You just don&#39;t want</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.739" end="00:12:59.299" style="s2">to pay.</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.859" end="00:13:00.539" style="s2">Are you two broke?</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.299" end="00:13:02.779" style="s2">Is this some act?</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.539" end="00:13:05.219" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the rush? I said I&#39;ll pay, and I</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.779" end="00:13:07.419" style="s2">will. Has Zack ever broken his word?</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.219" end="00:13:09.219" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said barbecue was on you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.419" end="00:13:10.739" style="s2">But we split the bill.</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.219" end="00:13:12.299" style="s2">You brag, then eat your words.</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.739" end="00:13:13.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got somewhere to be.</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.299" end="00:13:14.779" style="s2">How long will this take?</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.939" end="00:13:17.019" style="s2">I shouldn&#39;t have come.</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.779" end="00:13:18.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, I had a nail appointment today.</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.019" end="00:13:20.539" style="s2">Now it&#39;s ruined.</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.859" end="00:13:23.019" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s with your roommate? Didn&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.539" end="00:13:24.379" style="s2">say she was a gullible idiot? Now look,</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.019" end="00:13:25.979" style="s2">you&#39;ve made me look like a fool.</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.379" end="00:13:28.619" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why yell at me?</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.979" end="00:13:29.819" style="s2">I called. I messaged her, too. What can</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.619" end="00:13:31.139" style="s2">I do if she won&#39;t answer?</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.819" end="00:13:32.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.139" end="00:13:33.979" style="s2">If we can&#39;t pay today, I&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.499" end="00:13:35.419" style="s2">humiliated.</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.979" end="00:13:37.819" style="s2">Figure something out.</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.419" end="00:13:39.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, send me the code now, or I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.819" end="00:13:40.724" style="s2">never bring you braised chicken feet and</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.659" end="00:13:40.859" style="s2">duck neck again.</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.724" end="00:13:44.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.859" end="00:13:47.619" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Code sent. 0 1 2 3</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.739" end="00:13:50.499" style="s2">Got it. The code came through.</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.619" end="00:13:52.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you see? Told you so. When has my</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.499" end="00:13:54.179" style="s2">sweet wife ever let me down? Whatever</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.939" end="00:13:55.219" style="s2">you want to eat or drink, [music] it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.179" end="00:13:56.619" style="s2">on me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.219" end="00:13:57.459" style="s2">Order anything.</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.619" end="00:13:58.379" style="s2">We&#39;ll add more.</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.459" end="00:14:00.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For real?</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.379" end="00:14:01.579" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I lie, may I die broke. Zack keeps</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.699" end="00:14:02.379" style="s2">his word.</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.579" end="00:14:03.979" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey.</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.379" end="00:14:06.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Four more drunken crabs, eight pork</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.979" end="00:14:08.179" style="s2">feet, and berry juice all around. My</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.139" end="00:14:11.259" style="s2">sweet wife&#39;s here for my birthday today.</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.179" end="00:14:11.259" style="s2">Eat and drink your fill.</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.899" end="00:14:15.941" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You knew better and sent me the code,</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.019" end="00:14:18.221" style="s2">but you nearly made Zack and me lose</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.941" end="00:14:19.941" style="s2">face before his friends. We&#39;ll settle</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.221" end="00:14:23.981" style="s2">this at the dorm.</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.941" end="00:14:23.981" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, honey. Here, have a big one.</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.381" end="00:14:30.141" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you my roommate&#39;s a pushover.</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.021" end="00:14:31.861" style="s2">But you doubted me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.141" end="00:14:33.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is your roommate stupid?</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.861" end="00:14:34.181" style="s2">You used her card for ages and she never</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.621" end="00:14:35.901" style="s2">knew.</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.181" end="00:14:37.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s a rich fool.</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.901" end="00:14:39.061" style="s2">If her card weren&#39;t loaded, I&#39;d have</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.461" end="00:14:40.781" style="s2">ditched her by now.</p>
<p begin="00:14:39.061" end="00:14:42.221" style="s2">She plays nice at the dorm, bringing me</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.781" end="00:14:43.501" style="s2">deli food.</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.221" end="00:14:44.901" style="s2">Like I even care.</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.501" end="00:14:46.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy, honey.</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.901" end="00:14:48.221" style="s2">Then use her card more.</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.621" end="00:14:49.701" style="s2">Get more of your favorites, pork feet</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.221" end="00:14:51.701" style="s2">and drunken crab.</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.701" end="00:14:54.061" style="s2">People like her should be bled dry.</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.701" end="00:14:55.981" style="s2">Don&#39;t save her a dime.</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.061" end="00:14:57.341" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And get this, she has money but no</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.981" end="00:14:58.861" style="s2">brains.</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.341" end="00:15:00.461" style="s2">Every time I use her card to buy</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.861" end="00:15:03.061" style="s2">whatever I want,</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.461" end="00:15:04.661" style="s2">she never notices. She&#39;s dumb as a rock.</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.061" end="00:15:06.661" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if she finds out?</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.661" end="00:15:08.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll deal with it then.</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.661" end="00:15:10.221" style="s2">We&#39;re roommates.</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.261" end="00:15:12.701" style="s2">What&#39;s she going to do about it? She&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.221" end="00:15:14.261" style="s2">sulk a few days, then she&#39;ll go back to</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.701" end="00:15:15.981" style="s2">being my bestie.</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.261" end="00:15:18.221" style="s2">She craves this shop&#39;s deli food and</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.981" end="00:15:20.061" style="s2">needs me to get it. Then she&#39;ll let me</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.221" end="00:15:23.301" style="s2">use her card again.</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.061" end="00:15:23.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My honey&#39;s the best.</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.560" end="00:15:27.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.541" end="00:15:29.581" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweet. The more, the better.</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.701" end="00:15:31.781" style="s2">When the bill comes,</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.581" end="00:15:34.341" style="s2">you&#39;ll be sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.781" end="00:15:35.861" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Done already? Order more.</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.341" end="00:15:37.301" style="s2">People will think we can&#39;t afford this</p>
<p begin="00:15:35.861" end="00:15:39.101" style="s2">food.</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.301" end="00:15:42.181" style="s2">Three of everything. No one leaves till</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.101" end="00:15:43.941" style="s2">it&#39;s gone. Zach, now that&#39;s a real man.</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.181" end="00:15:46.221" style="s2">It&#39;s Zach&#39;s birthday.</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.941" end="00:15:49.261" style="s2">Today, Zach rules. To Zach.</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.221" end="00:15:49.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Happy birthday.</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.501" end="00:15:54.941" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Babe,</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.461" end="00:15:55.621" style="s2">we&#39;ve charged $14,000. Isn&#39;t that a bit</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.941" end="00:15:57.341" style="s2">much?</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.621" end="00:15:59.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the fear? She&#39;s got money on the</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.341" end="00:16:01.421" style="s2">card. Worst case, cry to your roommate</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.821" end="00:16:03.181" style="s2">and she&#39;ll cave.</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.421" end="00:16:05.501" style="s2">Honey, you saw how my roommates mocked</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.181" end="00:16:07.741" style="s2">me earlier. You saw it. I finally get to</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.501" end="00:16:09.101" style="s2">show them up. Don&#39;t embarrass me now.</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.741" end="00:16:10.581" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.101" end="00:16:12.661" style="s2">Your call.</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.581" end="00:16:14.741" style="s2">Today, I&#39;ll make sure you look good.</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.661" end="00:16:15.341" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Open up, babe. Try your favorite pork</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.741" end="00:16:18.022" style="s2">hock.</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.341" end="00:16:19.862" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, you spent big on Zach today. Say a</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.022" end="00:16:21.222" style="s2">few words. Speech.</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.862" end="00:16:23.862" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.222" end="00:16:23.862" style="s2">I&#39;ll talk.</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.742" end="00:16:29.622" style="s2">You&#39;re all good friends of my husband&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.182" end="00:16:31.382" style="s2">People used to misjudge him, calling him</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.622" end="00:16:33.662" style="s2">a total cheapskate.</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.382" end="00:16:34.862" style="s2">This meal cost $14,000.</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.662" end="00:16:36.222" style="s2">Still think he&#39;s cheap?</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.862" end="00:16:38.022" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course not.</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.222" end="00:16:40.022" style="s2">Who dares call Zach cheap?</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.022" end="00:16:43.742" style="s2">I&#39;ll be first to object. I usually keep</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.022" end="00:16:47.742" style="s2">a low profile. But when I host, I go all</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.742" end="00:16:50.302" style="s2">out. To Zach. To Samantha. To Zach. To</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.742" end="00:16:52.641" style="s2">Samantha.</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.302" end="00:16:52.782" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is Samantha&#39;s bag. Wow.</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.641" end="00:16:54.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.782" end="00:16:55.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She can afford designer stuff, but still</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.742" end="00:16:57.702" style="s2">uses your card.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.702" end="00:16:59.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When she first moved in, her suitcase</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.702" end="00:17:02.262" style="s2">was falling apart. I thought she&#39;d go</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.622" end="00:17:04.462" style="s2">hungry, so I bought her snacks.</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.262" end="00:17:07.062" style="s2">She took every snack and piled the trash</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.462" end="00:17:10.062" style="s2">on my desk.</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.062" end="00:17:12.222" style="s2">Hi, I&#39;m Serena. We&#39;re roommates now. My</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.062" end="00:17:14.822" style="s2">mom made [music] these. They&#39;re so good.</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.222" end="00:17:18.422" style="s2">Try one. I&#39;ve got more.</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.822" end="00:17:18.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks. I was starving.</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.662" end="00:17:22.862" style="s2">Who does that?</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.062" end="00:17:25.302" style="s2">And you put [music] up with it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.862" end="00:17:28.182" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not all. She mooches makeup off</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.302" end="00:17:30.542" style="s2">us and returns nothing. Skips the power</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.182" end="00:17:32.742" style="s2">bill.</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.542" end="00:17:35.062" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, this works great. Can I borrow</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.742" end="00:17:35.062" style="s2">it?</p>
<p begin="00:17:41.302" end="00:17:44.862" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The power bill&#39;s due. It&#39;s three bucks</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.342" end="00:17:47.982" style="s2">each. Send it to me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.862" end="00:17:49.582" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, I hit my transfer limit. Cover</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.982" end="00:17:50.422" style="s2">me for now. I&#39;ll [music] pay you next</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.582" end="00:17:52.662" style="s2">month.</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.422" end="00:17:54.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d always thought her family was poor,</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.662" end="00:17:56.177" style="s2">so I cut her some slack.</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.542" end="00:17:57.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But some people, give them an inch</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.177" end="00:17:59.182" style="s2">[music] and they won&#39;t appreciate it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.942" end="00:18:01.222" style="s2">They&#39;ll take a mile and take your</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.182" end="00:18:03.822" style="s2">kindness for granted. That&#39;s how</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.222" end="00:18:05.822" style="s2">kindness breeds resentment.</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.822" end="00:18:09.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That saying is true.</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.822" end="00:18:09.622" style="s2">The pitiful can be despicable.</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.062" end="00:18:13.582" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $15,000. Is she nuts?</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.782" end="00:18:17.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just settling the score.</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.942" end="00:18:22.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, what&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.022" end="00:18:25.343" style="s2">I got a text saying your Deli Rewards</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.743" end="00:18:27.103" style="s2">card was charged over $15,000.</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.343" end="00:18:27.863" style="s2">Was your card hacked? Want me to call</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.103" end="00:18:30.383" style="s2">the police?</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.863" end="00:18:33.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I know what&#39;s going on. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.383" end="00:18:34.983" style="s2">worry. I&#39;ll explain after I handle it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.103" end="00:18:37.063" style="s2">Got to go.</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.983" end="00:18:38.863" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, I&#39;m heading back to the dorm.</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.063" end="00:18:40.383" style="s2">I&#39;ll pass the Deli.</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.863" end="00:18:42.903" style="s2">Want me to grab some chicken feet and</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.383" end="00:18:44.647" style="s2">duck neck? Missed out today.</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.903" end="00:18:44.663" style="s2">Craving it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.647" end="00:18:47.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.663" end="00:18:48.863" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Samantha, what&#39;s she texting?</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.263" end="00:18:51.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s covering her tracks. She blew my</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.863" end="00:18:52.263" style="s2">$15,000 and panicked. Now she&#39;s stocking</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.143" end="00:18:54.303" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.263" end="00:18:56.063" style="s2">She&#39;s using the food as an excuse to ask</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.303" end="00:18:58.063" style="s2">for the code.</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.063" end="00:19:01.183" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s your plan?</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.063" end="00:19:04.383" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She took the bait. Good.</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.183" end="00:19:06.223" style="s2">Sure. I&#39;m craving it. Bring extra. Lunch</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.383" end="00:19:07.943" style="s2">for everyone tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.223" end="00:19:09.783" style="s2">You want to act? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.943" end="00:19:10.903" style="s2">I&#39;ll play along till the end.</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.783" end="00:19:14.863" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Babe,</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.903" end="00:19:14.863" style="s2">&gt;&gt; she said yes [music] and asked for more.</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.583" end="00:19:18.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Told you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.823" end="00:19:20.183" style="s2">She suspects nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.503" end="00:19:21.023" style="s2">Your idiot is too dumb to get [music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.183" end="00:19:22.183" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.023" end="00:19:23.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.183" end="00:19:26.183" style="s2">She&#39;s such a pushover.</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.743" end="00:19:27.583" style="s2">Now, she won&#39;t find out.</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.183" end="00:19:30.023" style="s2">I&#39;ll take a bag of chicken feet</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.583" end="00:19:32.543" style="s2">tomorrow. She&#39;ll even thank me.</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.023" end="00:19:33.463" style="s2">&gt;&gt; More pig&#39;s feet and drunken crab. Milk</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.543" end="00:19:34.783" style="s2">her dry.</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.463" end="00:19:36.783" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, check.</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.783" end="00:19:37.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here&#39;s today&#39;s bill for your table.</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.783" end="00:19:39.183" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Card.</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.303" end="00:19:42.463" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May I have the code?</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.183" end="00:19:42.463" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s 0123.</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.543" end="00:19:48.423" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, did you misread it? Check it and</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.503" end="00:19:50.863" style="s2">read it again.</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.423" end="00:19:53.583" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I read it right. It&#39;s just four digits.</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.863" end="00:19:53.583" style="s2">Try again.</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.983" end="00:19:58.423" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You must have mis-typed it.</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.703" end="00:20:00.423" style="s2">We&#39;ll do it ourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.423" end="00:20:04.558" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can this be? The code is wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.423" end="00:20:05.783" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t pay? Fine. Don&#39;t break my machine.</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.558" end="00:20:07.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.783" end="00:20:08.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said it was foolproof. What&#39;s going</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.663" end="00:20:09.983" style="s2">on?</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.263" end="00:20:11.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The machine must be broken.</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.983" end="00:20:13.223" style="s2">My code is right.</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.503" end="00:20:15.063" style="s2">You entered it, too. Not my fault.</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.223" end="00:20:16.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve run this place over 10 years. The</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.063" end="00:20:19.183" style="s2">machine&#39;s never failed. If you can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.943" end="00:20:21.863" style="s2">pay, figure something out.</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.183" end="00:20:23.383" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zack, is your girl really a sugar mama?</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.863" end="00:20:25.745" style="s2">It&#39;s been forever.</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.383" end="00:20:27.505" style="s2">Can you pay or not? Shut up. All that</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.745" end="00:20:30.185" style="s2">food didn&#39;t fill you up. Can&#39;t you give</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.505" end="00:20:32.065" style="s2">me a minute? Fine. You&#39;re paying, boss.</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.185" end="00:20:34.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, this machine&#39;s faulty. Try the</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.065" end="00:20:35.705" style="s2">register computer.</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.625" end="00:20:37.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena.</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.705" end="00:20:39.385" style="s2">Isn&#39;t she the girl who came yesterday to</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.225" end="00:20:40.905" style="s2">cancel her card then set a passcode?</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.385" end="00:20:42.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Close my card.</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.905" end="00:20:45.305" style="s2">I&#39;m worried someone could use my</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.305" end="00:20:45.305" style="s2">membership card.</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.705" end="00:20:48.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, I&#39;m the store manager. Someone</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.665" end="00:20:51.585" style="s2">used your membership card to spend</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.945" end="00:20:54.185" style="s2">$14,000 here. Did you authorize it?</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.585" end="00:20:56.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I didn&#39;t. Please keep this quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.185" end="00:20:58.145" style="s2">Next time she uses it, log every charge</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.505" end="00:20:59.545" style="s2">and we&#39;ll settle it later. Don&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.145" end="00:21:02.185" style="s2">them know you contacted me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.545" end="00:21:04.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, fixed yet?</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.185" end="00:21:05.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The reader is fine. Call the card</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.105" end="00:21:07.065" style="s2">holder.</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.745" end="00:21:09.905" style="s2">Card holder.</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.065" end="00:21:13.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zack, isn&#39;t that your sugar mama&#39;s card?</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.905" end="00:21:14.785" style="s2">Whose card are you guys using?</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.025" end="00:21:16.665" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, you&#39;ve got it wrong. Samantha&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.785" end="00:21:18.425" style="s2">cousin gave her the card. It&#39;s tied to</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.665" end="00:21:20.545" style="s2">her cousin&#39;s phone. It never needed a</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.425" end="00:21:22.545" style="s2">code. No clue why it did today.</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.545" end="00:21:24.385" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is she really your cousin?</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.545" end="00:21:26.585" style="s2">Why didn&#39;t you say that earlier?</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.385" end="00:21:28.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought it was no big deal. Besides,</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.585" end="00:21:28.945" style="s2">you don&#39;t trust [music] me or my sugar</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.225" end="00:21:31.785" style="s2">mama.</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.945" end="00:21:33.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, quick question. Know her?</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.785" end="00:21:34.185" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her?</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.305" end="00:21:36.105" style="s2">I do.</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.185" end="00:21:38.145" style="s2">She buys food here weekly. She&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.105" end="00:21:40.825" style="s2">regular. Hear that?</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.145" end="00:21:42.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What I tell you? See, I didn&#39;t lie.</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.825" end="00:21:44.185" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quit guessing. That explains it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.825" end="00:21:45.985" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I over thought it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.185" end="00:21:47.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who cares whose card it is?</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.985" end="00:21:48.385" style="s2">Pay up and let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.545" end="00:21:49.505" style="s2">I&#39;m exhausted.</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.385" end="00:21:52.585" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That last code must [music] have</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.505" end="00:21:54.905" style="s2">expired. I&#39;ll ask my cousin for another.</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.585" end="00:21:56.505" style="s2">Serena, send me that code again.</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.905" end="00:21:58.585" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The code?</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.505" end="00:22:00.425" style="s2">Didn&#39;t I give you one hours ago?</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.585" end="00:22:03.105" style="s2">The previous code expired. [music] A new</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.425" end="00:22:05.945" style="s2">one just came in. Just send it to me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.105" end="00:22:07.625" style="s2">What delivery takes several hours?</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.945" end="00:22:08.905" style="s2">Send the tracking number.</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.625" end="00:22:10.825" style="s2">I&#39;ll report her.</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.905" end="00:22:13.145" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, just give me the code. Forget</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.825" end="00:22:15.105" style="s2">the rest. I&#39;ve waited over an hour. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.145" end="00:22:18.185" style="s2">four digits. Hurry. Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.105" end="00:22:21.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. I&#39;ll find it. Hmm, found it.</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.185" end="00:22:21.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Great. Tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.665" end="00:22:25.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh? Samantha?</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.945" end="00:22:26.746" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you say this code [music] was for</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.225" end="00:22:27.906" style="s2">your delivery?</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.746" end="00:22:30.386" style="s2">What are you getting delivered to a</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.906" end="00:22:30.386" style="s2">deli?</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.546" end="00:22:36.626" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could that be? I</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.386" end="00:22:38.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just for confirming a delivery.</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.626" end="00:22:39.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is it from the deli?</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.106" end="00:22:41.026" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You read it wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.466" end="00:22:43.386" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, stop it.</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.026" end="00:22:45.506" style="s2">Just read me the code, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.386" end="00:22:47.786" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, just give me the code. It&#39;s only</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.506" end="00:22:49.386" style="s2">a few digits. Why you stalling?</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.786" end="00:22:50.666" style="s2">We&#39;re all waiting on you.</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.386" end="00:22:52.706" style="s2">I&#39;m warning you.</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.666" end="00:22:53.906" style="s2">Hurry up.</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.706" end="00:22:55.986" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She hung up on me?</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.906" end="00:22:57.346" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She just hung up on Zach. He uses your</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.986" end="00:22:59.186" style="s2">card like it&#39;s his.</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.346" end="00:23:00.746" style="s2">Just hearing him pisses me off.</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.186" end="00:23:03.986" style="s2">Why didn&#39;t you tear into him?</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.746" end="00:23:05.426" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yell at him? Waste of breath. Look, see?</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.986" end="00:23:08.986" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god.</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.426" end="00:23:11.146" style="s2">1,300 drunken crabs, 720 braised pig&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.986" end="00:23:12.586" style="s2">feet, plus tons of other charges. How</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.146" end="00:23:14.666" style="s2">dare your roommate do this?</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.586" end="00:23:16.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never eat any of this. She bought it</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.666" end="00:23:18.786" style="s2">all over the years, claiming she was</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.546" end="00:23:21.026" style="s2">picking up food for me. I let it slide</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.786" end="00:23:23.026" style="s2">once or twice, but look at this total.</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.026" end="00:23:25.626" style="s2">She&#39;s been using me as an ATM.</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.026" end="00:23:27.586" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You give her an inch, she wants a mile.</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.626" end="00:23:29.706" style="s2">Now she&#39;s raiding the whole bank.</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.586" end="00:23:31.746" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t let either of them off.</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.706" end="00:23:33.786" style="s2">Let&#39;s go. Time to end this.</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.746" end="00:23:36.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have to see this showdown myself.</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.786" end="00:23:36.506" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.906" end="00:23:40.626" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She hung up again.</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.466" end="00:23:41.706" style="s2">Is she nuts?</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.626" end="00:23:44.426" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.706" end="00:23:46.466" style="s2">I financed my pineapple phone.</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.426" end="00:23:48.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zach, what the hell are you doing? You</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.466" end="00:23:50.026" style="s2">said this was Samantha&#39;s cousin&#39;s card.</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.466" end="00:23:51.866" style="s2">Why yell at her? If it were his</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.026" end="00:23:53.026" style="s2">girlfriend&#39;s cousin, would she act like</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.866" end="00:23:55.346" style="s2">that?</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.026" end="00:23:57.706" style="s2">I bet the card belongs to someone else.</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.346" end="00:23:59.466" style="s2"> The card is my cousin&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.706" end="00:24:01.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care.</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.466" end="00:24:03.546" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you the sugar mama?</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.546" end="00:24:05.426" style="s2">If she won&#39;t answer, just pay the bill.</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.546" end="00:24:06.386" style="s2">Why waste so much of everyone&#39;s time?</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.426" end="00:24:07.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.386" end="00:24:08.946" style="s2">I have class early.</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.946" end="00:24:11.146" style="s2">Pay so we can leave.</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.946" end="00:24:12.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The card had a reload discount. Paying</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.146" end="00:24:14.426" style="s2">outright costs more.</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.546" end="00:24:17.026" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can afford it, right?</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.426" end="00:24:20.306" style="s2">Besides, you can still use the card.</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.026" end="00:24:23.746" style="s2">The money won&#39;t disappear. Or maybe</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.306" end="00:24:25.986" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Folks, $100,000 is no small sum. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.746" end="00:24:28.388" style="s2">ask one last time. Can you pay this bill</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.986" end="00:24:29.587" style="s2">or not? If you can&#39;t, I&#39;ll have to call</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.388" end="00:24:31.347" style="s2">the cops.</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.587" end="00:24:33.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call the cops for what? We&#39;re going to</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.347" end="00:24:34.427" style="s2">pay. The card&#39;s just acting up. Quit</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.707" end="00:24:37.547" style="s2">rushing us.</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.427" end="00:24:37.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop it. Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.107" end="00:24:41.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call Serena already, your cousin. Or do</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.067" end="00:24:43.107" style="s2">you want to pay it yourself?</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.547" end="00:24:45.148" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong with this place? The</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.107" end="00:24:47.067" style="s2">membership card won&#39;t even work. Why</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.148" end="00:24:48.587" style="s2">stay open? Your system is clearly</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.067" end="00:24:49.307" style="s2">broken. Do you rip off all your</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.587" end="00:24:51.427" style="s2">customers?</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.307" end="00:24:52.067" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t pay? Admit it. Don&#39;t blame the</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.427" end="00:24:54.107" style="s2">system.</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.067" end="00:24:56.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you talking about? It is the</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.107" end="00:24:56.747" style="s2">system.</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.388" end="00:25:04.867" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, this is your system problem. You.</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.268" end="00:25:08.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After all that, she used someone else&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.867" end="00:25:10.227" style="s2">card to treat everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.227" end="00:25:12.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew something was off.</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.227" end="00:25:14.227" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you say she was loaded?</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.307" end="00:25:15.227" style="s2">If she&#39;s so rich, why waste so much time</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.227" end="00:25:17.227" style="s2">on one card?</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.227" end="00:25:20.187" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way she&#39;s using her cousin&#39;s card.</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.227" end="00:25:21.307" style="s2"> It&#39;s Samantha&#39;s cousin&#39;s card.</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.187" end="00:25:22.892" style="s2">Don&#39;t buy the rumors.</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.307" end="00:25:22.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My cousin gave it to me.</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.892" end="00:25:24.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.947" end="00:25:25.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t make things up.</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.028" end="00:25:28.268" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care whose card. All eight of</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.947" end="00:25:30.467" style="s2">you ate here today, so pay the bill. How</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.268" end="00:25:31.707" style="s2">you split it is your problem. But right</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.467" end="00:25:33.388" style="s2">now, pay up.</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.707" end="00:25:36.148" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guys, listen.</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.388" end="00:25:37.987" style="s2">We all ate a lot today. How about this?</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.148" end="00:25:39.187" style="s2">Cover it for now, and Samantha and I</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.987" end="00:25:41.227" style="s2">will pay you back.</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.187" end="00:25:43.067" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, penny-pincher Zach, done pretending</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.227" end="00:25:45.307" style="s2">now? You said you&#39;d treat and invited</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.067" end="00:25:47.107" style="s2">us. What exactly did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.307" end="00:25:49.227" style="s2">Zach&#39;s buying tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.107" end="00:25:51.268" style="s2">Only a fool would pass it up.</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.227" end="00:25:52.747" style="s2">Now we pay? Shameless. It&#39;s your</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.268" end="00:25:54.707" style="s2">birthday.</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.747" end="00:25:55.268" style="s2">You had someone play rich and treat us.</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.707" end="00:25:57.467" style="s2">Why?</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.268" end="00:25:59.268" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you two pulling a routine?</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.467" end="00:26:00.547" style="s2">You offered to treat, then ask us for</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.268" end="00:26:02.627" style="s2">money.</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.547" end="00:26:04.587" style="s2">So, you were playing us. $14 grand split</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.627" end="00:26:06.268" style="s2">up is over $1,500</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.587" end="00:26:08.427" style="s2">each. If you hadn&#39;t offered, who&#39;d order</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.268" end="00:26:08.908" style="s2">all this? You expect me to pay?</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.427" end="00:26:10.668" style="s2">Dream on.</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.908" end="00:26:12.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You freeload and refuse to pay. You</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.668" end="00:26:15.388" style="s2">can&#39;t have it both ways. You ate, you</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.707" end="00:26:17.187" style="s2">pay. It&#39;s only fair. Especially you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.388" end="00:26:18.908" style="s2">Your girlfriend ordered the most. Why</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.187" end="00:26:21.307" style="s2">should I cover it all? Bess.</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.908" end="00:26:22.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Then take back what I ordered. I</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.307" end="00:26:25.028" style="s2">barely touched it.</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.547" end="00:26:26.747" style="s2">Sir, take it back. I don&#39;t want it.</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.028" end="00:26:28.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ate it. No returns.</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.747" end="00:26:29.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What kind of friends do you have?</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.747" end="00:26:31.429" style="s2">Don&#39;t invite me out again.</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.947" end="00:26:33.469" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.429" end="00:26:35.669" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t leave. No skipping out.</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.469" end="00:26:38.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They called you penny-pincher Zach. I</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.669" end="00:26:41.709" style="s2">never believed it. Now I do. Zach, this</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.909" end="00:26:41.709" style="s2">isn&#39;t over.</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.989" end="00:26:47.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m broke anyway. Do what you want.</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.589" end="00:26:49.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Talk it over. I&#39;ve locked the doors. No</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.629" end="00:26:51.229" style="s2">one leaves until the bill&#39;s paid.</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.549" end="00:26:53.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, what do we do now?</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.229" end="00:26:54.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is all your roommate&#39;s fault. She</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.149" end="00:26:56.909" style="s2">made me look like a fool. Call her</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.909" end="00:26:59.069" style="s2">already. You want to end up in jail?</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.909" end="00:27:01.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, please pick up. It will only</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.069" end="00:27:02.549" style="s2">take a second. Please, Serena, I beg</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.629" end="00:27:05.429" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.549" end="00:27:07.069" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, 911? I&#39;ve got dine and dashers in</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.429" end="00:27:10.069" style="s2">my shop.</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.069" end="00:27:11.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s her. Honey, she&#39;s calling me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.069" end="00:27:13.869" style="s2">She must have the verification code.</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.909" end="00:27:15.189" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I tell you to call the cops?</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.869" end="00:27:17.709" style="s2">Run the card.</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.189" end="00:27:19.789" style="s2">My wife has the code. No more funny</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.709" end="00:27:21.749" style="s2">business. Once my sweet wife pays the</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.789" end="00:27:22.869" style="s2">bill, every one of you will apologize to</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.749" end="00:27:24.269" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.869" end="00:27:27.829" style="s2">On your knees.</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.269" end="00:27:29.949" style="s2">And apologize. Honey, answer it. Show</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.829" end="00:27:30.949" style="s2">them what real money looks like.</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.949" end="00:27:32.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena,</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.949" end="00:27:34.549" style="s2">you finally called. Did you find the</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.749" end="00:27:34.709" style="s2">code? Read it to me, quick.</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.549" end="00:27:36.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.709" end="00:27:39.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Found it. Want me to read the code to</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.829" end="00:27:39.629" style="s2">you myself?</p>
<p begin="00:27:39.829" end="00:27:43.589" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Essie, Serena, why&#39;d you come?</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.109" end="00:27:45.269" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Couriers are thorough now.</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.589" end="00:27:45.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He came all the way to the deli for a</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.269" end="00:27:47.669" style="s2">pickup.</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.909" end="00:27:48.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is he? I&#39;ll give him the code</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.669" end="00:27:49.629" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.549" end="00:27:50.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too scared to say it?</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.629" end="00:27:53.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll say it for you.</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.909" end="00:27:54.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There was no courier and no pickup.</p>
<p begin="00:27:53.349" end="00:27:57.189" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You asked for the code [music] to charge</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.829" end="00:28:00.069" style="s2">my card to cover dinner, right?</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.189" end="00:28:02.949" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. That&#39;s not true. I used my own</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.069" end="00:28:05.029" style="s2">membership card. Serena, do me a favor.</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.949" end="00:28:06.309" style="s2">Please cover the bill. Once we&#39;re back,</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.029" end="00:28:08.309" style="s2">anything goes.</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.309" end="00:28:11.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Save face for you? Who do you think you</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.309" end="00:28:13.469" style="s2">are? Is your pride worth 14 grand? Tell</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.549" end="00:28:15.789" style="s2">everyone here whose card this is.</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.469" end="00:28:17.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I checked our system. This card belongs</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.789" end="00:28:19.909" style="s2">to Miss Serena Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.509" end="00:28:22.189" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You, Serena. How could you do this?</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.909" end="00:28:24.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You place Serena&#39;s 14 grand on a flashy</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.189" end="00:28:26.029" style="s2">dinner, then ask her to save face.</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.509" end="00:28:27.709" style="s2">Samantha, the nerve.</p>
<p begin="00:28:26.029" end="00:28:28.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s this got to do with you? Stop</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.709" end="00:28:30.749" style="s2">lying. What did she get?</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.709" end="00:28:33.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wrong. Weren&#39;t you treating everyone to</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.749" end="00:28:35.670" style="s2">make Zach look good? And wasn&#39;t that my</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.150" end="00:28:36.630" style="s2">card? If not, fine.</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.670" end="00:28:38.430" style="s2">Pay the bill.</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.630" end="00:28:40.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you really used someone else&#39;s card?</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.430" end="00:28:41.510" style="s2">The owner is right here.</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.310" end="00:28:42.630" style="s2">How can you still deny it?</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.510" end="00:28:43.990" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who does that?</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.630" end="00:28:45.910" style="s2">You use someone else&#39;s money to treat</p>
<p begin="00:28:43.990" end="00:28:46.550" style="s2">everyone, then act righteous.</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.910" end="00:28:48.230" style="s2">Unbelievable.</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.550" end="00:28:49.790" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They made her an easy mark, then got</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.230" end="00:28:50.670" style="s2">caught red-handed.</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.790" end="00:28:52.470" style="s2">That&#39;s insane.</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.670" end="00:28:55.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These are my membership card records.</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.470" end="00:28:57.830" style="s2">Over 3 years, $6,000 plus today&#39;s meal.</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.710" end="00:29:01.030" style="s2">That&#39;s 20,000 total. Will you two pay</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.830" end="00:29:02.310" style="s2">now or in installments?</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.030" end="00:29:04.270" style="s2">Serena,</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.310" end="00:29:06.110" style="s2">how can you treat me like this?</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.270" end="00:29:08.350" style="s2">Besides this one meal,</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.110" end="00:29:10.310" style="s2">when have I ever not brought you food?</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.350" end="00:29:11.670" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you eat it yourself?</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.310" end="00:29:12.950" style="s2">How dare you ask us for money?</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.670" end="00:29:14.590" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.950" end="00:29:16.030" style="s2">Samantha brings you food every weekend,</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.590" end="00:29:17.630" style="s2">rain or shine.</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.030" end="00:29:19.430" style="s2">Every single time.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.630" end="00:29:20.750" style="s2">She deserves credit for that.</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.430" end="00:29:21.910" style="s2">You don&#39;t even know how much she&#39;s done</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.750" end="00:29:23.310" style="s2">for you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.910" end="00:29:25.510" style="s2">Samantha really misjudged you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.310" end="00:29:25.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If that&#39;s true, maybe we can forgive</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.510" end="00:29:28.030" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.950" end="00:29:30.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They did go too far today, but the old</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.030" end="00:29:32.350" style="s2">charges are different.</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.350" end="00:29:34.630" style="s2">You two are a pair of toads, ugly and</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.350" end="00:29:34.910" style="s2">shameless. Do I owe you or do you owe</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.630" end="00:29:37.190" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.910" end="00:29:39.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You, you. You usually swipe my card for</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.190" end="00:29:41.070" style="s2">things I don&#39;t even eat, and I let it</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.150" end="00:29:42.310" style="s2">slide as payment for running errands.</p>
<p begin="00:29:41.070" end="00:29:43.510" style="s2">Have I ever said a word?</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.310" end="00:29:45.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This, watch your mouth.</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.510" end="00:29:47.990" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t. You swiped my card, fine, then</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.950" end="00:29:48.910" style="s2">badmouth me behind my back. Doesn&#39;t your</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.990" end="00:29:51.750" style="s2">conscience hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.910" end="00:29:53.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t. I never badmouthed you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.750" end="00:29:56.030" style="s2">Seriously? At a time like this?</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.910" end="00:29:57.750" style="s2">Still denying it? She&#39;s loaded and</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.030" end="00:29:59.350" style="s2">stupid. If not for the money on her</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.750" end="00:30:01.230" style="s2">card, I&#39;d have stopped bothering with</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.350" end="00:30:02.750" style="s2">her a long time ago. She&#39;s always</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.230" end="00:30:06.830" style="s2">playing nice in the dorm, giving me</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.750" end="00:30:06.830" style="s2">jelly too. Like I ever wanted it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.550" end="00:30:10.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh.</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.430" end="00:30:11.390" style="s2">Zack, you&#39;re really something.</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.110" end="00:30:11.750" style="s2">Using someone else&#39;s card to play big</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.390" end="00:30:13.150" style="s2">shot.</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.750" end="00:30:15.470" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought you were doing her favors for</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.150" end="00:30:17.630" style="s2">free. She gives you half, and you still</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.470" end="00:30:19.830" style="s2">sneak in your own charges. You take her</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.630" end="00:30:21.950" style="s2">food, then bite the hand that feeds you.</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.830" end="00:30:23.390" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t talk about my wife. She&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.950" end="00:30:25.430" style="s2">making the same mistake every girl</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.390" end="00:30:26.815" style="s2">makes. How did our dorm end up with</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.430" end="00:30:27.150" style="s2">someone like you?</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.815" end="00:30:31.070" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.150" end="00:30:31.070" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a disgrace. Get the hell out.</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.110" end="00:30:36.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re two-faced. Samantha, I&#39;m done</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.110" end="00:30:38.231" style="s2">with you. Pay me back or face the</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.752" end="00:30:39.916" style="s2">consequences.</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.231" end="00:30:40.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, don&#39;t be so nasty.</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.916" end="00:30:42.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.192" end="00:30:44.472" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never said I wouldn&#39;t pay you back.</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.351" end="00:30:47.192" style="s2">Friends help each other. I&#39;m short this</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.472" end="00:30:49.672" style="s2">month. I&#39;ll treat you next month, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.192" end="00:30:51.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Can you spend the $14,000 on</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.672" end="00:30:54.392" style="s2">that card? We&#39;re helping you so it won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.592" end="00:30:56.032" style="s2">go to waste. Besides, you&#39;re a woman.</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.392" end="00:30:57.712" style="s2">You put a fortune on a card, but can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.032" end="00:30:59.351" style="s2">manage your life. Aren&#39;t you afraid</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.712" end="00:31:00.632" style="s2">you&#39;ll die young? I wonder who&#39;d ever</p>
<p begin="00:30:59.351" end="00:31:01.832" style="s2">marry you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.632" end="00:31:03.552" style="s2">What family would take you?</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.832" end="00:31:05.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena buys snacks, and you say she&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.552" end="00:31:06.792" style="s2">die young. You live on bread and cold</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.392" end="00:31:09.312" style="s2">water. Aren&#39;t you saving for your</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.792" end="00:31:11.032" style="s2">coffin? Relax. Serena will live better</p>
<p begin="00:31:09.312" end="00:31:13.192" style="s2">than you, and longer, too.</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.032" end="00:31:15.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My worth isn&#39;t defined by who I marry.</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.192" end="00:31:17.472" style="s2">But you have no class, no vision, and</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.432" end="00:31:19.552" style="s2">everyone calls you a total cheapskate.</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.472" end="00:31:21.312" style="s2">Besides Samantha, I can&#39;t find anyone</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.552" end="00:31:23.072" style="s2">else rotten enough to be your match.</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.312" end="00:31:25.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, don&#39;t act superior over your</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.072" end="00:31:27.231" style="s2">family&#39;s money. Never count a poor man</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.032" end="00:31:27.832" style="s2">out. Give me 10 years. We&#39;ll see who</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.231" end="00:31:29.872" style="s2">laughs.</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.832" end="00:31:31.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, Serena, why waste your breath on</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.872" end="00:31:35.432" style="s2">him? He&#39;s just jealous.</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.952" end="00:31:37.912" style="s2">To him, $14,000 is a massive fortune.</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.432" end="00:31:40.072" style="s2">That shows how small his world is.</p>
<p begin="00:31:37.912" end="00:31:41.672" style="s2">You hit a nerve. He realized he&#39;ll only</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.072" end="00:31:42.592" style="s2">ever struggle to survive and can&#39;t hold</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.672" end="00:31:44.752" style="s2">a candle to you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.592" end="00:31:46.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You, bro, just stop.</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.752" end="00:31:48.392" style="s2">Every girl here knows you&#39;re poor and</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.192" end="00:31:50.112" style="s2">bitter, and completely useless.</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.392" end="00:31:51.672" style="s2">You&#39;re not insulting her.</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.112" end="00:31:53.712" style="s2">You&#39;re just making yourself look bad.</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.672" end="00:31:55.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ladies, let&#39;s steer clear of basic guys</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.712" end="00:31:56.672" style="s2">with big egos.</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.392" end="00:31:57.832" style="s2">He&#39;ll drag down our standards.</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.672" end="00:31:59.672" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.832" end="00:32:00.752" style="s2">Stay away from those two freaks.</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.672" end="00:32:05.112" style="s2">Ignore them from now on.</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.752" end="00:32:05.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Manager, enough. Call the cops.</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.872" end="00:32:10.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who called us?</p>
<p begin="00:32:09.231" end="00:32:11.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Officer,</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.352" end="00:32:13.352" style="s2">we called.</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.552" end="00:32:15.872" style="s2">They dined and dashed, and used my best</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.352" end="00:32:17.672" style="s2">friend&#39;s membership card for 4 14 grand.</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.872" end="00:32:19.872" style="s2">Here&#39;s the proof.</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.672" end="00:32:20.672" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s over $14,000, enough to press</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.872" end="00:32:22.392" style="s2">charges?</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.672" end="00:32:24.072" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The law will decide.</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.392" end="00:32:26.312" style="s2">They face years in prison. We&#39;ve got</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.072" end="00:32:27.272" style="s2">proof. You two, come with us.</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.312" end="00:32:29.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena,</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.272" end="00:32:31.471" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zack put me up to it. I didn&#39;t mean to</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.112" end="00:32:32.992" style="s2">charge so much. He said you&#39;re rich and</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.471" end="00:32:35.912" style="s2">clueless, and wouldn&#39;t notice more</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.992" end="00:32:36.712" style="s2">charges. He made me do it. Just arrest</p>
<p begin="00:32:35.912" end="00:32:38.471" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.712" end="00:32:40.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got some nerve, Samantha.</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.471" end="00:32:42.873" style="s2">Shameless much? You said the card meant</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.433" end="00:32:44.913" style="s2">free food, so I invited them. Now it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.873" end="00:32:47.193" style="s2">all on me? Way to pass the buck.</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.913" end="00:32:49.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ann, you make me pay on every date. You</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.193" end="00:32:51.753" style="s2">even split the hotel bill. You know my</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.233" end="00:32:53.113" style="s2">monthly allowance. How could you not? If</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.753" end="00:32:55.153" style="s2">you hadn&#39;t kept nagging me about your</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.113" end="00:32:55.553" style="s2">birthday every day, would I use Serena&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.153" end="00:32:57.473" style="s2">card?</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.553" end="00:32:59.193" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I say to use her card, or buy my</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.473" end="00:33:01.353" style="s2">roommate&#39;s dinner? Your vanity got the</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.193" end="00:33:03.113" style="s2">best of you. You wanted to look rich.</p>
<p begin="00:33:01.353" end="00:33:03.753" style="s2">Now you&#39;re dragging me down. Not a</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.113" end="00:33:05.313" style="s2">chance.</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.753" end="00:33:06.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last turn on rats.</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.313" end="00:33:08.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.513" end="00:33:09.233" style="s2">You&#39;re both coming with me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.153" end="00:33:11.913" style="s2">We&#39;ll sort this out.</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.233" end="00:33:13.073" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Officer, they dined and dashed, too. You</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.913" end="00:33:14.873" style="s2">can&#39;t just arrest us.</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.073" end="00:33:16.553" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zack was buying. How is this our</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.873" end="00:33:17.193" style="s2">problem? Don&#39;t play rich when you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.553" end="00:33:18.433" style="s2">broke.</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.193" end="00:33:20.993" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever.</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.433" end="00:33:22.993" style="s2">You boys ate the most just now. And you</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.993" end="00:33:24.433" style="s2">little vixens ordered non-stop, like</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.993" end="00:33:26.153" style="s2">you&#39;d miss out on a freebie.</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.433" end="00:33:27.073" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you calling a vixen?</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.153" end="00:33:28.913" style="s2">You&#39;ll pay.</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.073" end="00:33:30.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quiet, all of you. With me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.913" end="00:33:33.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could you both come make a statement?</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.913" end="00:33:33.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Um</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.113" end="00:33:38.753" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, we&#39;ve gotten the full picture.</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.833" end="00:33:40.153" style="s2">The evidence is solid.</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.753" end="00:33:42.113" style="s2">They both confessed to using your</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.153" end="00:33:44.073" style="s2">membership card without permission.</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.113" end="00:33:45.553" style="s2">We&#39;ll use the law to get you justice.</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.073" end="00:33:46.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, officer.</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.553" end="00:33:50.593" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, officer.</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.633" end="00:33:50.593" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Just doing our job.</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.873" end="00:33:54.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, why did you call the police</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.793" end="00:33:57.633" style="s2">without talking to me? We&#39;re all at the</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.913" end="00:33:58.473" style="s2">same school. Did it have to go this far?</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.633" end="00:33:59.913" style="s2">Senior,</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.473" end="00:34:01.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I gave them a chance.</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.913" end="00:34:03.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you&#39;re upset,</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.513" end="00:34:05.913" style="s2">but making this public hurts everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:34:03.713" end="00:34:07.793" style="s2">It&#39;ll damage the school&#39;s reputation.</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.913" end="00:34:09.753" style="s2">Why take it to the police? And as a</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.793" end="00:34:11.433" style="s2">young woman, having a police case could</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.753" end="00:34:13.313" style="s2">hurt your grad school chances. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.433" end="00:34:17.073" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $6,000 over 3 years.</p>
<p begin="00:34:13.313" end="00:34:19.193" style="s2">Plus $14,000 today. $20,000.</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.073" end="00:34:21.193" style="s2">My parents earned every cent of that 20</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.193" end="00:34:22.993" style="s2">grand. Was that easy for them?</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.193" end="00:34:24.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just spoke to the officer.</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.993" end="00:34:27.153" style="s2">The 14 grand on your card wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.513" end="00:34:29.393" style="s2">touched. And the earlier charges?</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.153" end="00:34:29.873" style="s2">You ate some of that food. Why not let</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.393" end="00:34:31.593" style="s2">it go?</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.873" end="00:34:33.553" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if I hadn&#39;t caught it? What if she</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.593" end="00:34:35.833" style="s2">drained my card? Would you still gloss</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.553" end="00:34:37.833" style="s2">it over? I did nothing wrong. I&#39;m the</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.833" end="00:34:40.033" style="s2">one who was robbed and conned. Why</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.833" end="00:34:43.514" style="s2">should I give in?</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.033" end="00:34:46.154" style="s2">I&#39;ll settle for repayment, an apology,</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.514" end="00:34:48.634" style="s2">Samantha&#39;s dorm transfer, and distress</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.154" end="00:34:50.794" style="s2">damages.</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.634" end="00:34:51.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those terms are too harsh. Her family</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.794" end="00:34:54.554" style="s2">will never agree.</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.954" end="00:34:56.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s easy. Let the courts decide. If</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.554" end="00:34:59.114" style="s2">she&#39;s publicly disciplined, expelled,</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.754" end="00:34:59.514" style="s2">and jailed for years, she can&#39;t blame</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.114" end="00:35:02.154" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.514" end="00:35:04.874" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will. I&#39;ll sign. Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.154" end="00:35:04.874" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t sign.</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.914" end="00:35:08.714" style="s2">Don&#39;t sign.</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.954" end="00:35:13.234" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, why are you here?</p>
<p begin="00:35:11.114" end="00:35:14.554" style="s2">Dear, you&#39;re Serena, right?</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.234" end="00:35:16.354" style="s2">I&#39;m begging you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.554" end="00:35:18.234" style="s2">Samantha didn&#39;t know better.</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.354" end="00:35:20.234" style="s2">She made one bad choice.</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.234" end="00:35:21.314" style="s2">Please don&#39;t press charges. She&#39;s so</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.234" end="00:35:23.314" style="s2">young.</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.314" end="00:35:24.634" style="s2">A record would ruin her life.</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.314" end="00:35:26.114" style="s2">Her brother plans to take the civil</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.634" end="00:35:27.834" style="s2">service exam.</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.114" end="00:35:29.994" style="s2">Please have some sympathy.</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.834" end="00:35:32.114" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.994" end="00:35:34.074" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When she used my card, took out loans,</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.114" end="00:35:35.834" style="s2">maxed out cards, and bought luxury</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.074" end="00:35:37.754" style="s2">goods, why didn&#39;t she ever think about</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.834" end="00:35:38.954" style="s2">her family? Your own daughter didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.754" end="00:35:40.754" style="s2">care.</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.954" end="00:35:42.954" style="s2">But you expect an outsider to?</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.754" end="00:35:45.074" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me to kneel. I&#39;ll bow at your feet.</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.954" end="00:35:47.034" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You. She&#39;s just a kid.</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.074" end="00:35:49.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, please get up. Let&#39;s talk this</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.034" end="00:35:51.994" style="s2">out. Serena wouldn&#39;t leave you helpless.</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.714" end="00:35:54.274" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, I told you already. She just</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.994" end="00:35:56.554" style="s2">needs to sign and repay me, plus pay for</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.274" end="00:35:57.994" style="s2">the distress. But you barged in. You</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.554" end="00:35:59.874" style="s2">don&#39;t plan to pay, do you?</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.994" end="00:36:02.074" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t go on.</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.874" end="00:36:04.234" style="s2">So money makes you special?</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.074" end="00:36:05.914" style="s2">The rich can bully us?</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.234" end="00:36:07.874" style="s2">I&#39;ll tell the whole school how you bully</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.914" end="00:36:09.554" style="s2">poor people like us.</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.874" end="00:36:10.714" style="s2">You&#39;re vicious.</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.554" end="00:36:12.034" style="s2">Karma will get you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.714" end="00:36:15.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.034" end="00:36:15.194" style="s2">You&#39;re being shameless.</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.914" end="00:36:21.034" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re at the police station. Complain to</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.274" end="00:36:23.314" style="s2">an officer. A tantrum won&#39;t help.</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.034" end="00:36:24.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. Keep making a scene, and</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.314" end="00:36:27.914" style="s2">I&#39;ll have to take you inside.</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.594" end="00:36:30.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. I&#39;ll sign. Sorry, Serena.</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.914" end="00:36:30.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No use.</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.514" end="00:36:37.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Samantha, hate me or blame me. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.114" end="00:36:39.554" style="s2">care. I&#39;m not the one making you sign.</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.594" end="00:36:41.874" style="s2">You did this to yourself. You owe me</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.554" end="00:36:46.916" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.874" end="00:36:46.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t over. I won&#39;t let you off.</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.236" end="00:36:54.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guys, look what I brought.</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.396" end="00:37:04.716" style="s2">Hi, I&#39;m Maya. I&#39;m your new roommate.</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.036" end="00:37:07.876" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Serena. My hands are full. Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.716" end="00:37:07.876" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, it&#39;s okay.</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.916" end="00:37:11.156" style="s2">Try these snacks.</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.516" end="00:37:17.676" style="s2">It&#39;s downstairs from my place. It&#39;s over</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.676" end="00:37:20.556" style="s2">10 years old. So good. Try it.</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.676" end="00:37:22.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once Samantha leaves and in comes Maya.</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.556" end="00:37:23.636" style="s2">Am I doomed to pig&#39;s feet and drunken</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.516" end="00:37:25.276" style="s2">crab?</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.636" end="00:37:28.036" style="s2">Hope she is no Samantha.</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.276" end="00:37:29.796" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, you eat it. I have my own.</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.036" end="00:37:31.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, isn&#39;t that the packaging from the</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.796" end="00:37:33.596" style="s2">deli by my place?</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.516" end="00:37:34.756" style="s2">Small world, Serena.</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.596" end="00:37:37.396" style="s2">You like their food, too?</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.756" end="00:37:40.076" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not my thing. It was a gift.</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.396" end="00:37:42.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, um I just mopped and cleaned the</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.076" end="00:37:43.796" style="s2">bathroom. If you need any help, just</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.516" end="00:37:46.156" style="s2">ask.</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.796" end="00:37:48.476" style="s2">I can&#39;t stand sitting idle.</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.156" end="00:37:49.476" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t sit still? Samantha said that,</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.476" end="00:37:52.076" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.476" end="00:37:54.076" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, why not say you like this stuff?</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.076" end="00:37:56.996" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The shop&#39;s near my place. I&#39;ll get it</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.076" end="00:37:59.276" style="s2">for you. I feel bad. It&#39;s fine.</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.996" end="00:38:02.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t sit still. No need. Just take</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.276" end="00:38:02.116" style="s2">care of yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.556" end="00:38:08.396" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, she cleaned the second she got</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.636" end="00:38:11.596" style="s2">here. Even the cobwebs under my bed.</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.396" end="00:38:13.676" style="s2">It feels so weird. She&#39;s just too eager.</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.596" end="00:38:15.076" style="s2">What&#39;s she after? Looks can deceive.</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.676" end="00:38:18.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if she&#39;s another Samantha?</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.076" end="00:38:18.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s wait and see.</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.836" end="00:38:24.676" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, we need to talk.</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.076" end="00:38:25.276" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zack, this is the women&#39;s dorm. How&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.676" end="00:38:27.196" style="s2">you get in?</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.276" end="00:38:30.076" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told the RA I was helping Samantha</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.196" end="00:38:32.276" style="s2">move, so she let [music] me in. So, men</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.076" end="00:38:33.876" style="s2">come into this building all the time.</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.276" end="00:38:35.876" style="s2">Drop the innocent act.</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.876" end="00:38:38.076" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zack, just say it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.876" end="00:38:39.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, you ruined my life. You got</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.076" end="00:38:41.276" style="s2">Samantha kicked out and got me</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.316" end="00:38:43.156" style="s2">sanctioned and put on probation. Now the</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.276" end="00:38:44.876" style="s2">whole department&#39;s laughing at us. My</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.156" end="00:38:47.877" style="s2">parents called and yelled at me for 2</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.876" end="00:38:49.197" style="s2">hours. They may stop paying my tuition.</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.877" end="00:38:51.637" style="s2">This is all your fault.</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.197" end="00:38:52.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zack, don&#39;t you deserve punishment?</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.637" end="00:38:54.157" style="s2"></p>
<p begin="00:38:52.917" end="00:38:55.477" style="s2">If you just shared and not set that</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.157" end="00:38:56.557" style="s2">stupid code, none of this would have</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.477" end="00:38:58.077" style="s2">happened.</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.557" end="00:38:59.157" style="s2">You came after me.</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.077" end="00:39:00.197" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.157" end="00:39:01.757" style="s2">Then we all go down.</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.197" end="00:39:04.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You forced your way into the women&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.757" end="00:39:06.917" style="s2">dorm and broke the law. Leave now while</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.117" end="00:39:09.957" style="s2">you still can or I&#39;m calling the police.</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.917" end="00:39:11.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The police? Go ahead. Call them.</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.957" end="00:39:14.237" style="s2">Let&#39;s see if they arrive before I deal</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.797" end="00:39:14.237" style="s2">with you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.477" end="00:39:18.157" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zack, are you insane? I&#39;m warning you</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.477" end="00:39:18.837" style="s2">I&#39;m live streaming. Everyone watching</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.157" end="00:39:20.397" style="s2">saw that.</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.837" end="00:39:23.237" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I called the cops.</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.397" end="00:39:23.237" style="s2">I really did.</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.837" end="00:39:31.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You trespassed in our dorm. You bully</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.317" end="00:39:33.197" style="s2">girls.</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.517" end="00:39:35.057" style="s2">You hit my roommate.</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.197" end="00:39:35.157" style="s2">I&#39;m a Taekwondo black belt.</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.057" end="00:39:38.077" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.157" end="00:39:40.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch what I can do.</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.077" end="00:39:40.477" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maya, you&#39;re so brave.</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.297" end="00:39:43.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.477" end="00:39:45.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yep, I&#39;m fearless. I&#39;ve trained since I</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.197" end="00:39:48.277" style="s2">was little. Third degree black belt.</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.517" end="00:39:50.357" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry. From now on, this dorm I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.277" end="00:39:52.557" style="s2">got your backs.</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.357" end="00:39:55.677" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maya, she&#39;s not like Samantha.</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.557" end="00:39:57.677" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, I think so, too.</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.677" end="00:39:58.877" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe I over thought it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.677" end="00:40:00.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s him.</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.877" end="00:40:01.997" style="s2">That girl Samantha moved out yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.917" end="00:40:04.517" style="s2">He was up to no good.</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.997" end="00:40:05.277" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, you&#39;ll pay for this. Just you</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.517" end="00:40:07.197" style="s2">wait.</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.277" end="00:40:09.157" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zack, this isn&#39;t just disciplinary</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.197" end="00:40:11.117" style="s2">probation anymore. You intended to hurt</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.157" end="00:40:14.517" style="s2">someone. You&#39;re facing expulsion [music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.117" end="00:40:16.077" style="s2">and prison. Repent behind bars. Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.517" end="00:40:17.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That little scoundrel almost slipped</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.077" end="00:40:19.597" style="s2">past me.</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.317" end="00:40:21.797" style="s2">It won&#39;t happen again.</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.597" end="00:40:24.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, Maya. Thanks for today. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.797" end="00:40:26.037" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need to thank me. We&#39;re roommates. Of</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.357" end="00:40:26.597" style="s2">course. Can I try the braised food you</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.037" end="00:40:28.797" style="s2">have?</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.597" end="00:40:29.277" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really? Awesome. Trust me, they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.797" end="00:40:32.597" style="s2">delicious.</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.277" end="00:40:32.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Um, it&#39;s really [music] good.</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.677" end="00:40:40.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll live here. This dump is livable.</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.917" end="00:40:42.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I asked the whole dorm. Not one room</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.797" end="00:40:44.037" style="s2">will take you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.197" end="00:40:45.797" style="s2">The school letting you stay is more than</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.037" end="00:40:49.357" style="s2">you deserve.</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.797" end="00:40:49.357" style="s2">Take this room or leave it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.623" end="00:40:57.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:40:59.158" end="00:41:03.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why me?</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.358" end="00:41:04.038" style="s2">Why do you send me to this hellhole?</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.038" end="00:41:07.118" style="s2">Serena,</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.038" end="00:41:07.118" style="s2">this is on you.</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.518" end="00:41:10.878" style="s2">Zack, you there?</p>
<p begin="00:41:10.078" end="00:41:12.358" style="s2">I&#39;m scared.</p>
<p begin="00:41:10.878" end="00:41:13.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scared, my ass.</p>
<p begin="00:41:12.358" end="00:41:17.358" style="s2">Pay up now.</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.438" end="00:41:17.358" style="s2">Pay, or I&#39;ll find you at school.</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.318" end="00:41:23.638" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I owe so much. How can I repay it?</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.558" end="00:41:26.278" style="s2">Serena,</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.638" end="00:41:26.278" style="s2">you did this.</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.358" end="00:41:31.878" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at this.</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.838" end="00:41:33.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re through. Don&#39;t contact me again.</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.878" end="00:41:36.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena ruined us.</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.718" end="00:41:37.958" style="s2">Are you okay with that?</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.598" end="00:41:39.078" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let it go.</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.958" end="00:41:41.118" style="s2">Why should I?</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.078" end="00:41:43.998" style="s2">Why am I buried in debt while she gets a</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.118" end="00:41:46.278" style="s2">full scholarship? Serena, I was nice</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.998" end="00:41:48.358" style="s2">enough to bring you food. Over one</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.278" end="00:41:51.078" style="s2">little mistake, you put me where I am</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.358" end="00:41:54.758" style="s2">today. I&#39;ll never forgive you.</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.078" end="00:41:54.758" style="s2">Scholarship? Dream on.</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.798" end="00:42:00.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See the campus forum last night. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.798" end="00:42:01.878" style="s2">Serena, management&#39;s top student. They</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.038" end="00:42:03.958" style="s2">say for a scholarship, she had her poor</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.878" end="00:42:06.238" style="s2">roommate sent to the police. Pretty,</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.958" end="00:42:07.878" style="s2">though. Who knew she was so vicious? She</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.238" end="00:42:10.118" style="s2">ruined someone just for a scholarship.</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.878" end="00:42:11.838" style="s2">It&#39;s all over the campus forum.</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.118" end="00:42:14.958" style="s2">They say she acts generous, treating</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.838" end="00:42:17.198" style="s2">people, but mocks poor students.</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.958" end="00:42:19.918" style="s2">Glad I&#39;m not her roommate.</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.198" end="00:42:21.558" style="s2">I&#39;d be totally screwed.</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.918" end="00:42:23.478" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, did you see the post about you</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.558" end="00:42:25.878" style="s2">blowing up on the campus forum?</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.478" end="00:42:26.718" style="s2">It&#39;s all lies. I got banned for blasting</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.878" end="00:42:29.118" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.718" end="00:42:31.158" style="s2">I&#39;m so mad. Is that true?</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.118" end="00:42:32.798" style="s2">Don&#39;t argue online next time.</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.158" end="00:42:36.438" style="s2">What if someone confesses and you miss</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.798" end="00:42:39.278" style="s2">it? Who? No one would ask me out.</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.438" end="00:42:41.838" style="s2">Wait. This is about your post.</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.278" end="00:42:41.838" style="s2">Let me see.</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.118" end="00:42:46.078" style="s2">Seriously? They&#39;re still using</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.878" end="00:42:48.078" style="s2">clickbait?</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.078" end="00:42:49.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A source says management major acts</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.078" end="00:42:51.758" style="s2">generous in the dorm to shame a poor</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.598" end="00:42:54.120" style="s2">student. Her roommate Samantha ran</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.758" end="00:42:55.800" style="s2">errands and got her food for 3 years.</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.120" end="00:42:57.720" style="s2">She still worked hard, but for a</p>
<p begin="00:42:55.800" end="00:42:59.600" style="s2">scholarship, Serena turned on her,</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.720" end="00:43:01.080" style="s2">pulled strings, and sent Samantha to the</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.600" end="00:43:03.720" style="s2">police. There&#39;s proof.</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.080" end="00:43:05.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. Does she deserve a scholarship?</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.720" end="00:43:07.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The school should check her ethics.</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.840" end="00:43:09.160" style="s2">She&#39;s out of control.</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.280" end="00:43:10.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hate belated apologies.</p>
<p begin="00:43:09.160" end="00:43:11.920" style="s2">Kill. Kill.</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.240" end="00:43:13.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s twisting the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.920" end="00:43:14.360" style="s2">Even I know Samantha did this to</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.240" end="00:43:16.440" style="s2">herself.</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.360" end="00:43:19.320" style="s2">How dare she post this to smear you?</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.440" end="00:43:21.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m innocent. I won&#39;t reply.</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.320" end="00:43:23.440" style="s2">I trust the school will step in.</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.560" end="00:43:25.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But people will believe her.</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.440" end="00:43:28.640" style="s2">What if Relax.</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.920" end="00:43:31.040" style="s2">Serena, your scholarship eligibility is</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.640" end="00:43:32.560" style="s2">suspended.</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.040" end="00:43:34.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could this be?</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.560" end="00:43:36.880" style="s2">They froze my scholarship.</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.800" end="00:43:38.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is all Samantha&#39;s doing. I&#39;ll go</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.880" end="00:43:40.400" style="s2">find her.</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.000" end="00:43:41.480" style="s2">That jerk needs a lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.400" end="00:43:43.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.480" end="00:43:44.760" style="s2">If you hit her now, won&#39;t that prove her</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.240" end="00:43:46.400" style="s2">post was true?</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.760" end="00:43:47.960" style="s2">I&#39;m just so mad.</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.400" end="00:43:49.640" style="s2">Serena, what now?</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.960" end="00:43:51.240" style="s2">I&#39;ll follow you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.640" end="00:43:53.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, look.</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.240" end="00:43:55.440" style="s2">Samantha posted from her own account.</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.040" end="00:43:57.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We used to be roommates. Every year, I</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.440" end="00:43:59.560" style="s2">won the full scholarship, but she forced</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.720" end="00:44:01.360" style="s2">me to give it up. Are poor people</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.560" end="00:44:03.000" style="s2">destined to be crushed by the rich?</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.360" end="00:44:04.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t take this. Where does Serena</p>
<p begin="00:44:03.000" end="00:44:07.000" style="s2">live? I&#39;ll get justice for that poor</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.600" end="00:44:08.000" style="s2">student. Won&#39;t anyone stop her? Is there</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.000" end="00:44:08.520" style="s2">no justice?</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.000" end="00:44:10.680" style="s2">No law?</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.520" end="00:44:13.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you always won the scholarship.</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.680" end="00:44:15.880" style="s2">Playing the victim. Nice. And pictures</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.000" end="00:44:17.800" style="s2">don&#39;t lie, huh? Samantha. Samantha, I</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.880" end="00:44:21.120" style="s2">was wrong about you. Serena.</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.800" end="00:44:23.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom&#39;s sick. She has hospital bills.</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.120" end="00:44:24.360" style="s2">I really need that money. Your grades</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.280" end="00:44:25.880" style="s2">are great.</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.360" end="00:44:27.640" style="s2">You can win next year.</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.880" end="00:44:29.200" style="s2">This is my only chance.</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.640" end="00:44:30.960" style="s2">I can&#39;t lose my mom.</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.200" end="00:44:32.560" style="s2">Please, can you give me the scholarship?</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.960" end="00:44:34.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please don&#39;t get up.</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.560" end="00:44:36.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, please say yes. Just help me</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.720" end="00:44:38.200" style="s2">this once. Please.</p>
<p begin="00:44:36.440" end="00:44:39.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Okay. [music] You can have it.</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.200" end="00:44:40.680" style="s2">Now, get up.</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.040" end="00:44:44.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really? I knew you were the best,</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.680" end="00:44:45.920" style="s2">Serena. I&#39;ll repay you someday. I swear.</p>
<p begin="00:44:44.000" end="00:44:47.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Samantha, is this how you repay me?</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.920" end="00:44:48.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t take it.</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.360" end="00:44:50.480" style="s2">She&#39;s gone too far.</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.960" end="00:44:51.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, let&#39;s go see the student</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.480" end="00:44:52.880" style="s2">advisor.</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.080" end="00:44:55.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait. [snorts] How can I?</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.880" end="00:44:58.081" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They froze your scholarship. Maya.</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.561" end="00:44:59.601" style="s2">Thank you. You&#39;re not like her.</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.081" end="00:45:01.521" style="s2">Trust me.</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.601" end="00:45:03.201" style="s2">Just let this play out.</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.521" end="00:45:05.921" style="s2">The higher she climbs,</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.201" end="00:45:07.481" style="s2">the worse her fall.</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.921" end="00:45:09.441" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s Serena. She stole a poor</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.481" end="00:45:10.921" style="s2">student&#39;s scholarship. I used to think</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.441" end="00:45:12.721" style="s2">she was pretty. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.921" end="00:45:14.721" style="s2">Now she even looks different. I heard</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.721" end="00:45:16.241" style="s2">Serena stole the scholarship, buried her</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.721" end="00:45:20.361" style="s2">in debt, forced her to dump her</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.241" end="00:45:20.361" style="s2">boyfriend, and ruined her whole family.</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.441" end="00:45:26.761" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, why run?</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.881" end="00:45:33.761" style="s2">Relax.</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.321" end="00:45:35.311" style="s2">I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.761" end="00:45:35.841" style="s2">No one can hurt you.</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.311" end="00:45:38.441" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.841" end="00:45:40.551" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Expand the equation, apply Fourier.</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.441" end="00:45:40.921" style="s2">Got it? You&#39;re not dumb, just too hasty.</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.551" end="00:45:43.801" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.921" end="00:45:44.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t. I just remembered I left</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.801" end="00:45:46.561" style="s2">something.</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.721" end="00:45:48.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why avoid me?</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.561" end="00:45:49.601" style="s2">Guilty?</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.161" end="00:45:51.641" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not at all.</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.601" end="00:45:53.801" style="s2">They made all that up.</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.641" end="00:45:55.721" style="s2">Do you believe me?</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.801" end="00:45:57.241" style="s2">Just forget I asked.</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.721" end="00:45:58.601" style="s2">You must have seen those campus forum</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.241" end="00:46:00.681" style="s2">posts, too.</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.601" end="00:46:03.161" style="s2">You think I&#39;m a bad person, don&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.681" end="00:46:05.281" style="s2">You broke Zach and me up. You stuck me</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.161" end="00:46:07.881" style="s2">in storage. Crushing on campus</p>
<p begin="00:46:05.281" end="00:46:09.681" style="s2">heartthrob Ethan. I&#39;ll make him hate you</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.881" end="00:46:11.521" style="s2">and ignore you. You&#39;ll know [music] how</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.681" end="00:46:15.361" style="s2">it feels when your crush hates you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.521" end="00:46:15.361" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those posts, I read them all.</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.681" end="00:46:22.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He said he&#39;d seen it all. What does he</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.561" end="00:46:25.321" style="s2">think? Is he going to confront [music]</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.201" end="00:46:25.321" style="s2">me and cut me off?</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.361" end="00:46:31.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Compared to those made-up posts,</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.001" end="00:46:32.601" style="s2">I trust you more.</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.561" end="00:46:34.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.601" end="00:46:35.761" style="s2">You trust me?</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.001" end="00:46:38.081" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The girl I know isn&#39;t the girl in those</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.761" end="00:46:39.081" style="s2">posts.</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.081" end="00:46:41.641" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.081" end="00:46:42.601" style="s2">Why does Mr. Popular believe you?</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.641" end="00:46:45.841" style="s2">Serena,</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.601" end="00:46:45.841" style="s2">I&#39;ll make your life hell.</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.641" end="00:46:51.481" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I compared all your grades with</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.881" end="00:46:53.881" style="s2">Samantha&#39;s since enrollment, including</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.481" end="00:46:56.121" style="s2">GPA, class grades, community service,</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.881" end="00:46:57.922" style="s2">and every competition award. Each time,</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.121" end="00:46:59.402" style="s2">you came out on top.</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.922" end="00:47:01.162" style="s2">Her only edge was low-income bonus</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.402" end="00:47:02.483" style="s2">points, but in the overall review, the</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.162" end="00:47:03.523" style="s2">past scholarships should have gone to</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.483" end="00:47:04.523" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.523" end="00:47:05.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good guy.</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.523" end="00:47:06.763" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Say what?</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.442" end="00:47:08.682" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:47:06.763" end="00:47:11.283" style="s2">I said President Ethan&#39;s analysis makes</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.682" end="00:47:14.483" style="s2">sense. You dug pretty deep. Did you</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.283" end="00:47:14.483" style="s2">research all that for me?</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.642" end="00:47:18.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena,</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.682" end="00:47:20.003" style="s2">I think Big Money set you up.</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.323" end="00:47:21.422" style="s2">Someone did this on purpose and buried</p>
<p begin="00:47:20.003" end="00:47:22.483" style="s2">your application to push Samantha ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.422" end="00:47:24.203" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.483" end="00:47:25.682" style="s2">You deserve that scholarship.</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.203" end="00:47:27.483" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That seems unlikely.</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.682" end="00:47:29.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t that odd? With your grades and</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.483" end="00:47:30.843" style="s2">resume, why for three straight years did</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.843" end="00:47:33.642" style="s2">you give up your spot?</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.843" end="00:47:35.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. I only gave it to her once.</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.642" end="00:47:38.442" style="s2">How did she get it all three years?</p>
<p begin="00:47:35.523" end="00:47:40.483" style="s2">Here&#39;s what happened.</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.442" end="00:47:42.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that&#39;s it. I thought I&#39;d found a huge</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.483" end="00:47:44.922" style="s2">conspiracy, but you were just too kind</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.602" end="00:47:46.243" style="s2">and someone took advantage. Dummy, don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.922" end="00:47:48.602" style="s2">trust [music] people so easily ever</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.243" end="00:47:48.602" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.763" end="00:47:51.882" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said, &quot;Trust no one.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.882" end="00:47:54.483" style="s2">And you?</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.882" end="00:47:54.483" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Except me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.068" end="00:48:02.088" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.843" end="00:48:13.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, want to grab lunch?</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.402" end="00:48:13.442" style="s2">They&#39;ve got pork belly.</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.043" end="00:48:19.682" style="s2">Serena, [music] pork belly.</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.003" end="00:48:21.402" style="s2">What&#39;s up? Possessed?</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.682" end="00:48:23.682" style="s2">I called her so many times.</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.402" end="00:48:26.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena here. Spring has sprung. At this</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.682" end="00:48:27.483" style="s2">rate, not just any spring. It&#39;s peach</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.243" end="00:48:28.882" style="s2">blossoms everywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:48:27.483" end="00:48:31.483" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, she&#39;s in love?</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.882" end="00:48:33.882" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet, but soon. Look at her face,</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.483" end="00:48:35.963" style="s2">just like when I was a total fan girl.</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.882" end="00:48:38.563" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, let her enjoy herself. Let&#39;s get</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.963" end="00:48:38.563" style="s2">pork belly.</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.678" end="00:48:42.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.323" end="00:48:49.763" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Friday at 2:00, the business school</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.803" end="00:48:52.243" style="s2">holds a scholarship dispute hearing.</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.763" end="00:48:54.843" style="s2">Samantha, be there on time.</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.243" end="00:48:58.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? A hearing?</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.843" end="00:48:58.523" style="s2">You mean I have to face her?</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.442" end="00:49:05.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? I&#39;m busy. If that&#39;s all, bye.</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.084" end="00:49:06.444" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zack.</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.124" end="00:49:08.724" style="s2">Bad news.</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.444" end="00:49:10.964" style="s2">The student advisor just told me the</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.724" end="00:49:13.124" style="s2">school&#39;s holding a scholarship hearing</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.964" end="00:49:14.164" style="s2">and I have to face Serina.</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.124" end="00:49:16.724" style="s2">What do I do?</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.164" end="00:49:18.284" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then face her. Why panic? Haven&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.724" end="00:49:20.444" style="s2">always won the scholarship?</p>
<p begin="00:49:18.284" end="00:49:21.564" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s true, though.</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.444" end="00:49:23.204" style="s2">I&#39;m scared.</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.564" end="00:49:25.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you scared of?</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.204" end="00:49:27.684" style="s2">This is solid evidence. Serina&#39;s name</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.724" end="00:49:29.324" style="s2">isn&#39;t even on the list.</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.684" end="00:49:30.044" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But this scholarship has Serina&#39;s name</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.324" end="00:49:31.884" style="s2">on it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.044" end="00:49:34.044" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I bet she bribed the student advisor and</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.884" end="00:49:34.684" style="s2">stole your spot. You&#39;re right. Why</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.044" end="00:49:36.324" style="s2">worry?</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.684" end="00:49:38.284" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zack has no idea.</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.324" end="00:49:39.724" style="s2">I got those scholarships by begging on</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.284" end="00:49:40.564" style="s2">my knees.</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.724" end="00:49:42.164" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.564" end="00:49:43.559" style="s2">I need him to make this go away for</p>
<p begin="00:49:42.164" end="00:49:44.124" style="s2">good.</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.559" end="00:49:45.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.124" end="00:49:48.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.244" end="00:49:48.244" style="s2">Do one more thing for me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.844" end="00:49:53.124" style="s2">Serina has no proof. She can&#39;t prove she</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.204" end="00:49:55.404" style="s2">let me have the scholarship. For the</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.124" end="00:49:57.324" style="s2">past 3 years, I&#39;ve won the scholarship.</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.404" end="00:50:00.684" style="s2">That means it was rightfully mine.</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.324" end="00:50:00.684" style="s2">Right. That&#39;s it.</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.204" end="00:50:05.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today&#39;s hearing concerns the business</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.764" end="00:50:08.204" style="s2">school&#39;s full scholarship dispute. Both</p>
<p begin="00:50:05.124" end="00:50:08.204" style="s2">sides, come in.</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.244" end="00:50:18.964" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serina, karma got you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.604" end="00:50:23.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serina, your GPA ranks first in</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.884" end="00:50:28.244" style="s2">management. You&#39;re what we call the top</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.844" end="00:50:28.244" style="s2">student. Begin your defense.</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.764" end="00:50:33.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello.</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.644" end="00:50:37.524" style="s2">That covers all my academic achievements</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.444" end="00:50:39.084" style="s2">since I enrolled, my activity records</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.524" end="00:50:43.084" style="s2">and awards from national and</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.084" end="00:50:43.084" style="s2">international contests. Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.524" end="00:50:47.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.884" end="00:50:49.444" style="s2">A full gigapascals.</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.244" end="00:50:50.644" style="s2">National contests, seven golds.</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.444" end="00:50:52.244" style="s2">Jang&#39;s score.</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.644" end="00:50:53.444" style="s2">Many papers [music] published.</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.244" end="00:50:55.044" style="s2">Jang&#39;s score.</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.444" end="00:50:56.244" style="s2">Excellent academics.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.044" end="00:50:57.684" style="s2">Jang&#39;s score.</p>
<p begin="00:50:56.244" end="00:50:59.644" style="s2">You&#39;re highly capable. One more</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.684" end="00:51:01.724" style="s2">question. What do you think about</p>
<p begin="00:50:59.644" end="00:51:02.565" style="s2">top student social duty?</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.724" end="00:51:04.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here.</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.565" end="00:51:06.365" style="s2">The dean&#39;s questioning her.</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.525" end="00:51:08.005" style="s2">Serena, you&#39;re too nervous to even</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.365" end="00:51:10.725" style="s2">speak, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.005" end="00:51:12.965" style="s2">Let&#39;s see you get out of this.</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.725" end="00:51:15.205" style="s2">Dean, I believe an outstanding student</p>
<p begin="00:51:12.965" end="00:51:17.525" style="s2">social duty isn&#39;t just a slogan. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.205" end="00:51:19.445" style="s2">choosing, when given the chance, to give</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.525" end="00:51:21.725" style="s2">resources to those in greater need.</p>
<p begin="00:51:19.445" end="00:51:22.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, Samantha claimed on the campus forum</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.725" end="00:51:24.445" style="s2">you forced her to forfeit her</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.845" end="00:51:25.685" style="s2">scholarship and go to the local police</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.445" end="00:51:27.725" style="s2">station.</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.685" end="00:51:30.525" style="s2">Is that true?</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.725" end="00:51:32.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She did go to the station.</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.525" end="00:51:34.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew it. She doesn&#39;t deserve it. She</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.805" end="00:51:36.765" style="s2">admitted forcing Samantha into the local</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.845" end="00:51:39.245" style="s2">police station. What more proof do you</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.765" end="00:51:40.605" style="s2">need? Disqualify her. Can you guys let</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.245" end="00:51:42.205" style="s2">her finish?</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.605" end="00:51:44.805" style="s2">In a rush to die.</p>
<p begin="00:51:42.205" end="00:51:45.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mean, are you admitting you did all</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.805" end="00:51:46.525" style="s2">that?</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.405" end="00:51:48.165" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Dean.</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.525" end="00:51:49.445" style="s2">She deserved to be there.</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.165" end="00:51:51.645" style="s2">And I never made her give up a</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.445" end="00:51:53.565" style="s2">scholarship. In fact, all her</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.645" end="00:51:54.445" style="s2">scholarships over the years were ones I</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.565" end="00:51:56.645" style="s2">gave up for her.</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.445" end="00:51:57.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meaning what? She gave Samantha the</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.645" end="00:51:59.205" style="s2">scholarship.</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.805" end="00:52:01.045" style="s2"></p>
<p begin="00:51:59.205" end="00:52:01.965" style="s2">Who&#39;d give someone a scholarship? Damn</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.045" end="00:52:03.565" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.965" end="00:52:05.005" style="s2">Did they believe her?</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.565" end="00:52:06.605" style="s2">Even if they don&#39;t completely, her</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.005" end="00:52:07.965" style="s2">grades are so good, they&#39;ll probably</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.605" end="00:52:10.045" style="s2">side with her.</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.965" end="00:52:12.685" style="s2">I need to make the first move.</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.045" end="00:52:14.445" style="s2">Serena, please leave me alone. I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.685" end="00:52:16.445" style="s2">take it anymore. You made me sign a</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.445" end="00:52:18.365" style="s2">five-figure IOU. Why take my</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.445" end="00:52:20.405" style="s2">scholarship, too? Haven&#39;t you hurt me</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.365" end="00:52:22.605" style="s2">enough? Must you drive me to my death to</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.405" end="00:52:24.005" style="s2">be satisfied?</p>
<p begin="00:52:22.605" end="00:52:26.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Samantha&#39;s the real victim. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.005" end="00:52:28.845" style="s2">Serena went way too far.</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.325" end="00:52:30.405" style="s2">Yeah, in this day and age</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.845" end="00:52:33.085" style="s2">how can this kind of campus bullying</p>
<p begin="00:52:30.405" end="00:52:33.085" style="s2">still happen?</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.965" end="00:52:38.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Samantha, you say I stole your</p>
<p begin="00:52:35.845" end="00:52:41.765" style="s2">scholarship. [music] Then tell me, how</p>
<p begin="00:52:38.005" end="00:52:41.765" style="s2">did you get your freshman scholarship?</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.125" end="00:52:45.485" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.165" end="00:52:46.805" style="s2">I earned it with my grades.</p>
