<p begin="01:06:00.975" end="01:06:04.815" style="s2">turned. Posts bashing Samantha hit 1,000</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.655" end="01:06:07.175" style="s2">comments.</p>
<p begin="01:06:04.815" end="01:06:08.775" style="s2">Samantha and Zach are both trending.</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.175" end="01:06:10.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They really do.</p>
<p begin="01:06:08.775" end="01:06:13.335" style="s2">People online want to sign Serena an</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.495" end="01:06:14.935" style="s2">apology. If apologies work, why need the</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.335" end="01:06:16.735" style="s2">police?</p>
<p begin="01:06:14.935" end="01:06:19.375" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let them. I&#39;m happy today. Order</p>
<p begin="01:06:16.735" end="01:06:22.575" style="s2">whatever. It&#39;s on me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.375" end="01:06:22.575" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Long live Serena.</p>
<p begin="01:06:25.415" end="01:06:28.855" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, isn&#39;t that the star trending</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.335" end="01:06:31.095" style="s2">online?</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.855" end="01:06:32.735" style="s2">Everyone, look. The sugar mama who stole</p>
<p begin="01:06:31.095" end="01:06:34.695" style="s2">10 grand from her roommate to treat</p>
<p begin="01:06:32.735" end="01:06:36.495" style="s2">everyone. What does she look like? Get</p>
<p begin="01:06:34.695" end="01:06:39.495" style="s2">out of our dorm. There&#39;s no room for a</p>
<p begin="01:06:36.495" end="01:06:39.495" style="s2">big shot like you.</p>
<p begin="01:06:40.175" end="01:06:45.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did this happen?</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.015" end="01:06:48.615" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This year&#39;s full scholarship winner from</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.135" end="01:06:48.615" style="s2">management, Serena.</p>
<p begin="01:06:49.615" end="01:06:53.255" style="s2">Serena, congratulations.</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.895" end="01:06:55.935" style="s2">You&#39;ve earned this honor.</p>
<p begin="01:06:53.255" end="01:06:58.015" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Dean. Thanks to my teachers</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.935" end="01:07:00.015" style="s2">and the friends who stood by me. This</p>
<p begin="01:06:58.015" end="01:07:02.375" style="s2">scholarship is not just an honor, but a</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.015" end="01:07:04.215" style="s2">responsibility. I&#39;ll keep working hard</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.375" end="01:07:05.815" style="s2">and live up to expectations.</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.215" end="01:07:07.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you here?</p>
<p begin="01:07:05.815" end="01:07:11.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you can come, but I can&#39;t?</p>
<p begin="01:07:07.695" end="01:07:16.175" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One room left. $50. Who wants it?</p>
<p begin="01:07:11.495" end="01:07:16.175" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do. Same as always, $25 each.</p>
<p begin="01:07:17.466" end="01:07:19.615" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:07:17.735" end="01:07:21.255" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look what you did. Now all the haters</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.615" end="01:07:21.815" style="s2">are trending, and my whole family&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="01:07:21.255" end="01:07:23.456" style="s2">doxxed.</p>
<p begin="01:07:21.815" end="01:07:25.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think I wanted this?</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.456" end="01:07:27.136" style="s2">I can&#39;t even turn on my phone.</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.416" end="01:07:28.936" style="s2">All debt collectors and hate texts.</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.136" end="01:07:31.096" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s on you. If you hadn&#39;t used that</p>
<p begin="01:07:28.936" end="01:07:33.056" style="s2">card to treat them, we&#39;d be fine.</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.096" end="01:07:34.896" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who did I use the card for? To make you</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.056" end="01:07:36.616" style="s2">look good on your birthday, around your</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.896" end="01:07:38.776" style="s2">roommates. You kept calling me sweet</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.616" end="01:07:40.936" style="s2">wife. Now you blame me.</p>
<p begin="01:07:38.776" end="01:07:41.896" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t tell you to use her card.</p>
<p begin="01:07:40.936" end="01:07:44.976" style="s2">You had it coming.</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.896" end="01:07:44.976" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zack, you bastard.</p>
<p begin="01:07:49.736" end="01:07:54.056" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put this on. [music] Stay warm.</p>
<p begin="01:07:51.576" end="01:07:56.896" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, thanks.</p>
<p begin="01:07:54.056" end="01:07:59.456" style="s2">Ethan, lately you&#39;ve helped me research</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.896" end="01:08:01.896" style="s2">and prep for my defense. I never found</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.456" end="01:08:03.972" style="s2">the time to properly thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:01.896" end="01:08:04.376" style="s2">You really are such an amazing person.</p>
<p begin="01:08:03.972" end="01:08:06.056" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.376" end="01:08:08.296" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I just get friend zoned?</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.056" end="01:08:11.176" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, that&#39;s not what I meant.</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.296" end="01:08:11.176" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, what did you mean?</p>
<p begin="01:08:13.456" end="01:08:18.136" style="s2">Lovely moon tonight. You&#39;re even</p>
<p begin="01:08:15.576" end="01:08:18.136" style="s2">lovelier.</p>
<p begin="01:08:20.456" end="01:08:23.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My phone.</p>
<p begin="01:08:21.136" end="01:08:24.896" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My phone and luggage are gone.</p>
<p begin="01:08:23.016" end="01:08:26.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone stole them during our fight last</p>
<p begin="01:08:24.896" end="01:08:29.216" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.656" end="01:08:30.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello? Our phones and bags were stolen.</p>
<p begin="01:08:29.216" end="01:08:30.976" style="s2">What kind of motel is this?</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.827" end="01:08:33.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.976" end="01:08:35.256" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seven bucks a night. What do you expect?</p>
<p begin="01:08:33.336" end="01:08:37.616" style="s2">You didn&#39;t watch your stuff. Your stay</p>
<p begin="01:08:35.256" end="01:08:39.176" style="s2">ended at noon. Renew or get out.</p>
<p begin="01:08:37.616" end="01:08:40.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our phones were stolen.</p>
<p begin="01:08:39.176" end="01:08:43.256" style="s2">How can we pay to stay?</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.216" end="01:08:45.056" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s your problem.</p>
<p begin="01:08:43.256" end="01:08:46.856" style="s2">Wait, aren&#39;t you two going viral for</p>
<p begin="01:08:45.056" end="01:08:51.496" style="s2">dining on someone else&#39;s card? You</p>
<p begin="01:08:46.856" end="01:08:51.496" style="s2">thieves. Get out. Not welcome here.</p>
<p begin="01:08:52.016" end="01:08:55.016" style="s2">Zack, I want to go back.</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.616" end="01:08:56.576" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go back for what?</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.016" end="01:08:57.696" style="s2">Don&#39;t you know we were both expelled?</p>
<p begin="01:08:56.576" end="01:08:59.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:08:57.696" end="01:09:01.576" style="s2">But we&#39;d have a place to stay.</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.536" end="01:09:04.176" style="s2">That storage room is livable.</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.576" end="01:09:05.056" style="s2">Where else can we go?</p>
<p begin="01:09:04.176" end="01:09:07.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:09:05.056" end="01:09:07.616" style="s2">We&#39;ll go see.</p>
<p begin="01:09:08.056" end="01:09:12.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, you two. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.136" end="01:09:13.896" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re students here.</p>
<p begin="01:09:12.216" end="01:09:15.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The expelled pair, huh?</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.896" end="01:09:16.816" style="s2">Drop the act.</p>
<p begin="01:09:15.136" end="01:09:18.456" style="s2">You&#39;ve both been kicked out.</p>
<p begin="01:09:16.816" end="01:09:20.296" style="s2">Orders from the top. No one select you</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.456" end="01:09:21.456" style="s2">into harass anyone else.</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.296" end="01:09:22.216" style="s2">Get out.</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.456" end="01:09:23.936" style="s2">You&#39;re in the way.</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.216" end="01:09:25.056" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, it&#39;s those two from the viral</p>
<p begin="01:09:23.936" end="01:09:26.657" style="s2">post.</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.056" end="01:09:27.657" style="s2">Why are they still here? Get to pick for</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.657" end="01:09:28.858" style="s2">campus forum.</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.657" end="01:09:31.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.858" end="01:09:33.498" style="s2">Want everyone laughing at us?</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.617" end="01:09:34.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why those two come back? Haven&#39;t they</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.498" end="01:09:36.418" style="s2">been shamed enough?</p>
<p begin="01:09:34.498" end="01:09:38.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They got off easy without years behind</p>
<p begin="01:09:36.418" end="01:09:38.938" style="s2">bars.</p>
<p begin="01:09:39.338" end="01:09:43.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My aunt lives here. We can crash here</p>
<p begin="01:09:41.257" end="01:09:45.378" style="s2">for a few days. Once you get the money,</p>
<p begin="01:09:43.418" end="01:09:48.297" style="s2">you go your way and I&#39;ll go mine.</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.378" end="01:09:48.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, deal.</p>
<p begin="01:09:48.538" end="01:09:52.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zack, why do you come?</p>
<p begin="01:09:52.338" end="01:09:55.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunt, we&#39;re in a bind. Can we stay two</p>
<p begin="01:09:54.657" end="01:09:58.058" style="s2">days?</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.458" end="01:09:59.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A bind? You just got expelled.</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.058" end="01:10:01.177" style="s2">Your mom told me.</p>
<p begin="01:09:59.458" end="01:10:02.617" style="s2">My house is too small for VIPs like you,</p>
<p begin="01:10:01.177" end="01:10:04.898" style="s2">two.</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.617" end="01:10:05.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunt, two days. We&#39;ll go when we find a</p>
<p begin="01:10:04.898" end="01:10:07.338" style="s2">place.</p>
<p begin="01:10:05.458" end="01:10:08.378" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t call me aunt. You&#39;re a disgrace to</p>
<p begin="01:10:07.338" end="01:10:10.258" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="01:10:08.378" end="01:10:11.978" style="s2">Your cousin plans on grad school and the</p>
<p begin="01:10:10.258" end="01:10:15.818" style="s2">civil service exam.</p>
<p begin="01:10:11.978" end="01:10:15.818" style="s2">Leave now or I&#39;ll call security.</p>
<p begin="01:10:16.538" end="01:10:21.578" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough raging. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.778" end="01:10:22.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a world. Even family kicked me out.</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.578" end="01:10:24.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where do we sleep tonight?</p>
<p begin="01:10:22.938" end="01:10:26.578" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re asking me? If it weren&#39;t for you,</p>
<p begin="01:10:24.938" end="01:10:29.018" style="s2">would I be here?</p>
<p begin="01:10:26.578" end="01:10:31.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not arguing. Follow me. I know</p>
<p begin="01:10:29.018" end="01:10:32.218" style="s2">somewhere we can go.</p>
<p begin="01:10:31.137" end="01:10:34.578" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena,</p>
<p begin="01:10:32.218" end="01:10:36.698" style="s2">Ethan talks about you every day.</p>
<p begin="01:10:34.578" end="01:10:38.338" style="s2">I finally get to meet you.</p>
<p begin="01:10:36.698" end="01:10:40.378" style="s2">You&#39;re gorgeous.</p>
<p begin="01:10:38.338" end="01:10:40.818" style="s2">No wonder you&#39;ve stolen my boy&#39;s heart.</p>
<p begin="01:10:40.378" end="01:10:42.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:10:40.818" end="01:10:44.778" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too kind, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="01:10:42.137" end="01:10:46.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s her first visit. Don&#39;t scare her.</p>
<p begin="01:10:44.778" end="01:10:47.097" style="s2">Serena, relax.</p>
<p begin="01:10:46.258" end="01:10:49.617" style="s2">Make yourself at home.</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.097" end="01:10:51.177" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come eat. Dig in. Ethan says you love</p>
<p begin="01:10:49.617" end="01:10:52.418" style="s2">sweets. Try some.</p>
<p begin="01:10:51.177" end="01:10:55.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="01:10:52.418" end="01:10:55.657" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like it? Come often. Dad&#39;ll cook for you</p>
<p begin="01:10:55.137" end="01:10:57.498" style="s2">daily.</p>
<p begin="01:10:55.657" end="01:10:59.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, why not you?</p>
<p begin="01:10:57.498" end="01:11:01.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One thing about the Carters, our men do</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.617" end="01:11:02.898" style="s2">the cooking.</p>
<p begin="01:11:01.097" end="01:11:07.058" style="s2">When Ethan marries you, if you don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.898" end="01:11:07.058" style="s2">like his cooking, I&#39;ll set him straight.</p>
<p begin="01:11:08.657" end="01:11:12.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, this is the place you said I could</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.137" end="01:11:14.418" style="s2">stay. Is this fit for humans? I thought</p>
<p begin="01:11:12.858" end="01:11:15.137" style="s2">you could at least find a motel for the</p>
<p begin="01:11:14.418" end="01:11:17.378" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="01:11:15.137" end="01:11:19.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A motel costs [music] money. Stay or</p>
<p begin="01:11:17.378" end="01:11:21.617" style="s2">leave. You can sleep on the street.</p>
<p begin="01:11:19.898" end="01:11:24.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t believe this. You had a good</p>
<p begin="01:11:21.617" end="01:11:25.498" style="s2">life, but had to go after Serena.</p>
<p begin="01:11:24.018" end="01:11:27.338" style="s2">Look what happened.</p>
<p begin="01:11:25.498" end="01:11:28.617" style="s2">Now everything&#39;s ruined.</p>
<p begin="01:11:27.338" end="01:11:30.619" style="s2">Samantha,</p>
<p begin="01:11:28.617" end="01:11:31.859" style="s2">I figured it out. Your birth chart</p>
<p begin="01:11:30.619" end="01:11:33.699" style="s2">cursed me.</p>
<p begin="01:11:31.859" end="01:11:34.859" style="s2">Anyone with you is doomed.</p>
<p begin="01:11:33.699" end="01:11:35.939" style="s2">Don&#39;t contact me again.</p>
<p begin="01:11:34.859" end="01:11:37.979" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:11:35.939" end="01:11:39.139" style="s2">I&#39;ve been wanting to say this.</p>
<p begin="01:11:37.979" end="01:11:41.219" style="s2">Zack, you&#39;re a penny [music] pincher,</p>
<p begin="01:11:39.139" end="01:11:43.499" style="s2">Zack, just like your name.</p>
<p begin="01:11:41.219" end="01:11:45.219" style="s2">You never spend a dime. For 3 years, the</p>
<p begin="01:11:43.499" end="01:11:46.419" style="s2">most expensive meal you bought me was 20</p>
<p begin="01:11:45.219" end="01:11:48.619" style="s2">bucks.</p>
<p begin="01:11:46.419" end="01:11:49.179" style="s2">You even split motel bills. You never</p>
<p begin="01:11:48.619" end="01:11:50.659" style="s2">loved me.</p>
<p begin="01:11:49.179" end="01:11:52.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t love you.</p>
<p begin="01:11:50.659" end="01:11:54.379" style="s2">If I didn&#39;t love you, why would I stay</p>
<p begin="01:11:52.139" end="01:11:55.739" style="s2">with someone like you for 3 years?</p>
<p begin="01:11:54.379" end="01:11:55.979" style="s2">I&#39;ve spent at least a few hundred on</p>
<p begin="01:11:55.739" end="01:11:58.179" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:11:55.979" end="01:11:59.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A few hundred? Zack, I used Serena&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.179" end="01:12:01.939" style="s2">card for you, swiping a hundred grand at</p>
<p begin="01:11:59.939" end="01:12:03.259" style="s2">a time without even blinking. Your</p>
<p begin="01:12:01.939" end="01:12:05.059" style="s2">little bit of money wasn&#39;t even the</p>
<p begin="01:12:03.259" end="01:12:07.339" style="s2">change from that meal. How dare you say</p>
<p begin="01:12:05.059" end="01:12:09.099" style="s2">that out loud? Forget it.</p>
<p begin="01:12:07.339" end="01:12:09.739" style="s2">Dating someone like you was my biggest</p>
<p begin="01:12:09.099" end="01:12:11.499" style="s2">mistake.</p>
<p begin="01:12:09.739" end="01:12:13.619" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Starting tomorrow, you take your own</p>
<p begin="01:12:11.499" end="01:12:16.259" style="s2">road, and I&#39;ll take mine. We owe each</p>
<p begin="01:12:13.619" end="01:12:19.859" style="s2">other nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.259" end="01:12:19.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go to hell, you jerk.</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.219" end="01:12:24.219" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, extra sugar. My girl likes it</p>
<p begin="01:12:23.539" end="01:12:25.979" style="s2">sweet.</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.219" end="01:12:28.619" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who said I&#39;d be your girlfriend?</p>
<p begin="01:12:25.979" end="01:12:30.419" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care. Yesterday, my mom took one</p>
<p begin="01:12:28.619" end="01:12:32.299" style="s2">look at you and loved you. Looks like</p>
<p begin="01:12:30.419" end="01:12:34.139" style="s2">I&#39;m yours for life.</p>
<p begin="01:12:32.299" end="01:12:35.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Flirt.</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.139" end="01:12:38.019" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, I&#39;m so sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:12:35.659" end="01:12:39.979" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay. Just replace it.</p>
<p begin="01:12:38.019" end="01:12:42.619" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks. One extra on me.</p>
<p begin="01:12:39.979" end="01:12:42.619" style="s2">Come back soon.</p>
<p begin="01:12:45.579" end="01:12:46.379" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:12:46.099" end="01:12:48.579" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey.</p>
<p begin="01:12:46.379" end="01:12:49.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you no shame? A grown man, fit and</p>
<p begin="01:12:48.579" end="01:12:52.299" style="s2">able, fighting me for a bun.</p>
<p begin="01:12:49.939" end="01:12:53.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll starve if I don&#39;t. Besides, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.299" end="01:12:56.419" style="s2">able-bodied, too, but I don&#39;t see you</p>
<p begin="01:12:53.939" end="01:12:56.419" style="s2">working.</p>
<p begin="01:12:56.739" end="01:12:59.939" style="s2">What&#39;s your problem?</p>
<p begin="01:12:58.259" end="01:13:01.539" style="s2">The bun fell down, yet you won&#39;t let us</p>
<p begin="01:12:59.939" end="01:13:03.899" style="s2">eat it, but you&#39;ll feed a dog.</p>
<p begin="01:13:01.539" end="01:13:05.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, we&#39;ve starved for ages. So, what</p>
<p begin="01:13:03.899" end="01:13:07.099" style="s2">if we eat a bun off the ground?</p>
<p begin="01:13:05.539" end="01:13:09.219" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Feed a dog a bun, and it&#39;ll wag its</p>
<p begin="01:13:07.099" end="01:13:10.619" style="s2">tail. Feed ungrateful wretches like you,</p>
<p begin="01:13:09.219" end="01:13:10.979" style="s2">what do I get?</p>
<p begin="01:13:10.619" end="01:13:11.299" style="s2">Huh.</p>
<p begin="01:13:10.979" end="01:13:15.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="01:13:11.299" end="01:13:15.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out. You&#39;re an eyesore.</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.299" end="01:13:20.979" style="s2">Samantha, I was wrong. I was angry last</p>
<p begin="01:13:18.219" end="01:13:23.459" style="s2">night. We&#39;ve been together 3 years. We</p>
<p begin="01:13:20.979" end="01:13:25.739" style="s2">can&#39;t just break up.</p>
<p begin="01:13:23.459" end="01:13:27.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zack, what are you trying to pull now?</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.739" end="01:13:29.059" style="s2">Weren&#39;t you fighting me for that bun?</p>
<p begin="01:13:27.459" end="01:13:29.499" style="s2">Why are you suddenly playing Mr. Nice</p>
<p begin="01:13:29.059" end="01:13:31.620" style="s2">Guy?</p>
<p begin="01:13:29.499" end="01:13:33.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is this so damn wary?</p>
<p begin="01:13:31.620" end="01:13:34.980" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, kid.</p>
<p begin="01:13:33.140" end="01:13:36.820" style="s2">The chick with you is hot. Bring her</p>
<p begin="01:13:34.980" end="01:13:38.860" style="s2">over for fun.</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.820" end="01:13:39.980" style="s2">If I enjoy her, you&#39;ll get a few hundred</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.860" end="01:13:40.900" style="s2">bucks.</p>
<p begin="01:13:39.980" end="01:13:42.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure.</p>
<p begin="01:13:40.900" end="01:13:43.220" style="s2">I&#39;ll bring her tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:13:42.100" end="01:13:44.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zack,</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.220" end="01:13:46.180" style="s2">I&#39;ve seen through you.</p>
<p begin="01:13:44.820" end="01:13:47.860" style="s2">You don&#39;t want to break up because you</p>
<p begin="01:13:46.180" end="01:13:49.620" style="s2">love me, but because you&#39;ll never find</p>
<p begin="01:13:47.860" end="01:13:50.580" style="s2">anyone as dumb and willing to bankroll</p>
<p begin="01:13:49.620" end="01:13:52.580" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:13:50.580" end="01:13:53.140" style="s2">I&#39;m not your ATM.</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.580" end="01:13:54.860" style="s2">No way.</p>
<p begin="01:13:53.140" end="01:13:56.380" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you talking about?</p>
<p begin="01:13:54.860" end="01:13:57.980" style="s2">I didn&#39;t mean that.</p>
<p begin="01:13:56.380" end="01:13:59.580" style="s2">I&#39;ll treat you right from now on. Please</p>
<p begin="01:13:57.980" end="01:14:01.500" style="s2">believe me.</p>
<p begin="01:13:59.580" end="01:14:02.860" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like hell I do. You&#39;re rotten to the</p>
<p begin="01:14:01.500" end="01:14:06.220" style="s2">core.</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.860" end="01:14:08.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop, Samantha. Stay right there, or</p>
<p begin="01:14:06.220" end="01:14:11.300" style="s2">you&#39;ll regret it.</p>
<p begin="01:14:08.740" end="01:14:12.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Act&#39;s over. I knew you were up to no</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.300" end="01:14:14.420" style="s2">good.</p>
<p begin="01:14:12.500" end="01:14:16.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m taking you somewhere.</p>
<p begin="01:14:14.420" end="01:14:16.820" style="s2">Just come with me, and we&#39;ll both make</p>
<p begin="01:14:16.220" end="01:14:18.420" style="s2">money.</p>
<p begin="01:14:16.820" end="01:14:19.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can make money with you?</p>
<p begin="01:14:18.420" end="01:14:21.020" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="01:14:19.420" end="01:14:22.700" style="s2">Are you trying to sell me?</p>
<p begin="01:14:21.020" end="01:14:23.580" style="s2">Zack, are you insane?</p>
<p begin="01:14:22.700" end="01:14:25.580" style="s2">I&#39;m your girlfriend.</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.580" end="01:14:27.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re barely getting by. What good is a</p>
<p begin="01:14:25.580" end="01:14:29.260" style="s2">girlfriend? Just do as I say, and I</p>
<p begin="01:14:27.940" end="01:14:32.140" style="s2">promise you&#39;ll get a cut.</p>
<p begin="01:14:29.260" end="01:14:32.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dream on.</p>
<p begin="01:14:38.300" end="01:14:42.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Samantha,</p>
<p begin="01:14:39.460" end="01:14:43.781" style="s2">stop fighting. Both our lives are over.</p>
<p begin="01:14:42.220" end="01:14:46.500" style="s2">You don&#39;t actually think you can ditch</p>
<p begin="01:14:43.781" end="01:14:48.660" style="s2">me and live a nice, normal life, do you?</p>
<p begin="01:14:46.500" end="01:14:50.660" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zack, give it up.</p>
<p begin="01:14:48.660" end="01:14:53.260" style="s2">I&#39;d rather beg under a bridge than ever</p>
<p begin="01:14:50.660" end="01:14:55.220" style="s2">be in cahoots with you again.</p>
<p begin="01:14:53.260" end="01:14:57.620" style="s2">You&#39;re a cold-blooded, selfish, stingy</p>
<p begin="01:14:55.220" end="01:15:00.540" style="s2">bastard.</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.620" end="01:15:01.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m selfish? After all I spent on you,</p>
<p begin="01:15:00.540" end="01:15:03.340" style="s2">you gold digger.</p>
<p begin="01:15:01.940" end="01:15:04.100" style="s2">If you don&#39;t agree today, you&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="01:15:03.340" end="01:15:09.060" style="s2">going anywhere.</p>
<p begin="01:15:04.100" end="01:15:09.060" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me. Help. Somebody help me.</p>
<p begin="01:15:09.660" end="01:15:14.260" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Somebody help. Someone&#39;s dying.</p>
<p begin="01:15:12.460" end="01:15:15.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You rotten troublemaker.</p>
<p begin="01:15:14.260" end="01:15:17.660" style="s2">She was perfectly fine.</p>
<p begin="01:15:15.900" end="01:15:19.300" style="s2">You left her badly hurt.</p>
<p begin="01:15:17.660" end="01:15:20.781" style="s2">Her whole life&#39;s ruined.</p>
<p begin="01:15:19.300" end="01:15:23.420" style="s2">How will you repay our losses?</p>
<p begin="01:15:20.781" end="01:15:25.660" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her family? This is a hospital. Please</p>
<p begin="01:15:23.420" end="01:15:26.980" style="s2">be quiet.</p>
<p begin="01:15:25.660" end="01:15:29.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that woman dead?</p>
<p begin="01:15:26.980" end="01:15:31.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her spine is badly damaged. She&#39;ll live,</p>
<p begin="01:15:29.700" end="01:15:34.342" style="s2">but the nerve damage is permanent. Her</p>
<p begin="01:15:31.740" end="01:15:37.902" style="s2">legs are paralyzed for life. She&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.342" end="01:15:37.902" style="s2">wheelchair bound for life.</p>
<p begin="01:15:38.982" end="01:15:44.662" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You vicious little brat. I plan to marry</p>
<p begin="01:15:41.782" end="01:15:46.582" style="s2">her off for a six-figure bride price.</p>
<p begin="01:15:44.662" end="01:15:51.062" style="s2">Now you crippled her.</p>
<p begin="01:15:46.582" end="01:15:51.062" style="s2">Pay up. You&#39;d better pay up today.</p>
<p begin="01:15:51.782" end="01:15:55.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My legs. Mom, I can&#39;t move my legs.</p>
<p begin="01:15:54.742" end="01:15:57.742" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong with them?</p>
<p begin="01:15:55.942" end="01:15:59.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quiet. [music] You&#39;re driving me nuts.</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.742" end="01:16:01.302" style="s2">You fell downstairs and were paralyzed.</p>
<p begin="01:15:59.902" end="01:16:03.062" style="s2">You&#39;ll use a wheelchair for life.</p>
<p begin="01:16:01.302" end="01:16:04.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zack, [music] you bastard.</p>
<p begin="01:16:03.062" end="01:16:06.342" style="s2">I hate you. I&#39;ll kill you.</p>
<p begin="01:16:04.422" end="01:16:08.382" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The doctor said it&#39;s incurable. She&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:16:06.342" end="01:16:10.382" style="s2">need care for life.</p>
<p begin="01:16:08.382" end="01:16:12.982" style="s2">If her family sues us, we&#39;ll go to</p>
<p begin="01:16:10.382" end="01:16:14.702" style="s2">prison. Dad, I don&#39;t want to go to jail.</p>
<p begin="01:16:12.982" end="01:16:17.192" style="s2">I&#39;ll care for her for the rest of her</p>
<p begin="01:16:14.702" end="01:16:19.022" style="s2">life, I swear. If her family won&#39;t sue,</p>
<p begin="01:16:17.192" end="01:16:21.502" style="s2">[music] I&#39;ll do anything.</p>
<p begin="01:16:19.022" end="01:16:23.542" style="s2">Ma&#39;am, Zack wronged Samantha, but you</p>
<p begin="01:16:21.502" end="01:16:25.062" style="s2">know our [music] situation.</p>
<p begin="01:16:23.542" end="01:16:26.982" style="s2">Still, Zack said he&#39;ll take</p>
<p begin="01:16:25.062" end="01:16:28.182" style="s2">responsibility and care for Samantha for</p>
<p begin="01:16:26.982" end="01:16:28.902" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="01:16:28.182" end="01:16:30.982" style="s2">Will that do?</p>
<p begin="01:16:28.902" end="01:16:32.982" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;ll [music] care for her? My girl&#39;s 20</p>
<p begin="01:16:30.982" end="01:16:34.702" style="s2">and was healthy. Her bride price was at</p>
<p begin="01:16:32.982" end="01:16:37.222" style="s2">least $100,000.</p>
<p begin="01:16:34.702" end="01:16:38.542" style="s2">Now she&#39;s disabled. Who&#39;d marry her? Can</p>
<p begin="01:16:37.222" end="01:16:41.182" style="s2">you afford that compensation?</p>
<p begin="01:16:38.542" end="01:16:43.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, I know I was wrong. Please let me</p>
<p begin="01:16:41.182" end="01:16:46.422" style="s2">make amends by caring for Samantha.</p>
<p begin="01:16:43.622" end="01:16:48.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You bastard. Zack, come here. You can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:16:46.422" end="01:16:48.702" style="s2">wait for me to die so you can be free,</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.633" end="01:16:49.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.702" end="01:16:51.582" style="s2">&gt;&gt; am I right?</p>
<p begin="01:16:49.702" end="01:16:52.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Samantha, no, that&#39;s not what I meant.</p>
<p begin="01:16:51.582" end="01:16:54.462" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="01:16:52.742" end="01:16:55.582" style="s2">I won&#39;t let you have your way.</p>
<p begin="01:16:54.462" end="01:16:56.582" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you say you&#39;d care for me for</p>
<p begin="01:16:55.582" end="01:16:57.542" style="s2">life?</p>
<p begin="01:16:56.582" end="01:16:58.742" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:16:57.542" end="01:17:01.462" style="s2">You owe me.</p>
<p begin="01:16:58.742" end="01:17:04.422" style="s2">So, spend your whole life atoning.</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.462" end="01:17:06.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, you look gorgeous in that gown,</p>
<p begin="01:17:04.422" end="01:17:08.022" style="s2">like an angel. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:17:06.542" end="01:17:09.982" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not that big a deal.</p>
<p begin="01:17:08.022" end="01:17:12.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m jealous of you and President Ethan.</p>
<p begin="01:17:09.982" end="01:17:13.942" style="s2">Married just 2 years after graduation.</p>
<p begin="01:17:12.142" end="01:17:16.262" style="s2">Career and love, you&#39;ve got it all. A</p>
<p begin="01:17:13.942" end="01:17:17.502" style="s2">house and car downtown, too. When&#39;s it</p>
<p begin="01:17:16.262" end="01:17:19.702" style="s2">my turn?</p>
<p begin="01:17:17.502" end="01:17:22.262" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re doing great, too. You&#39;re already</p>
<p begin="01:17:19.702" end="01:17:22.982" style="s2">a manager. I think your CEO has a thing</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.262" end="01:17:24.902" style="s2">for you.</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.982" end="01:17:26.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, don&#39;t say that.</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.902" end="01:17:28.782" style="s2">He&#39;s way out of my league, the CEO.</p>
<p begin="01:17:26.702" end="01:17:31.222" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t the CEO falls for me trope all the</p>
<p begin="01:17:28.782" end="01:17:33.582" style="s2">rage? You can do it. Go for it.</p>
<p begin="01:17:31.222" end="01:17:35.138" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, you&#39;re teasing me again. I had</p>
<p begin="01:17:33.582" end="01:17:37.223" style="s2">Samantha and Zack got married back</p>
<p begin="01:17:35.138" end="01:17:39.583" style="s2">[music] home. They say she was badly</p>
<p begin="01:17:37.223" end="01:17:40.943" style="s2">hurt, paralyzed from the waist down.</p>
<p begin="01:17:39.583" end="01:17:43.103" style="s2">Zach paid dearly.</p>
<p begin="01:17:40.943" end="01:17:45.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Try to burn me. You can&#39;t even feed me</p>
<p begin="01:17:43.103" end="01:17:46.623" style="s2">right. What can you do?</p>
<p begin="01:17:45.023" end="01:17:47.583" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Samantha,</p>
<p begin="01:17:46.623" end="01:17:49.103" style="s2">don&#39;t push it.</p>
<p begin="01:17:47.583" end="01:17:50.783" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m the one who&#39;s too much.</p>
<p begin="01:17:49.103" end="01:17:52.863" style="s2">You made me sleep with other men.</p>
<p begin="01:17:50.783" end="01:17:54.183" style="s2">You pushed me downstairs, no big deal.</p>
<p begin="01:17:52.863" end="01:17:55.383" style="s2">Zach, hear me.</p>
<p begin="01:17:54.183" end="01:17:56.423" style="s2">You owe me</p>
<p begin="01:17:55.383" end="01:17:58.503" style="s2">for life.</p>
<p begin="01:17:56.423" end="01:18:00.623" style="s2">If I can&#39;t be happy, neither can you. If</p>
<p begin="01:17:58.503" end="01:18:02.863" style="s2">I hadn&#39;t stolen Serena&#39;s card and been</p>
<p begin="01:18:00.623" end="01:18:03.943" style="s2">her real friend, I wouldn&#39;t have ended</p>
<p begin="01:18:02.863" end="01:18:06.823" style="s2">up like this, would I?</p>
<p begin="01:18:03.943" end="01:18:08.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Serena this, Serena that. Why do</p>
<p begin="01:18:06.823" end="01:18:10.383" style="s2">you care how she lives? Can you open</p>
<p begin="01:18:08.663" end="01:18:12.263" style="s2">your eyes and see what our life is now?</p>
<p begin="01:18:10.383" end="01:18:14.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re yelling at me. How dare you?</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.263" end="01:18:14.743" style="s2">Kneel.</p>
<p begin="01:18:16.623" end="01:18:22.223" style="s2">Serena, Ethan, here.</p>
<p begin="01:18:19.743" end="01:18:23.609" style="s2">I hear you&#39;re off on a honeymoon abroad.</p>
<p begin="01:18:22.223" end="01:18:24.143" style="s2">You&#39;ll hit the beach, scuba dive,</p>
<p begin="01:18:23.609" end="01:18:25.663" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:18:24.143" end="01:18:28.703" style="s2">and see the northern lights.</p>
<p begin="01:18:25.663" end="01:18:30.783" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow, so jealous. If you want to go, we</p>
<p begin="01:18:28.703" end="01:18:32.663" style="s2">girls can go next time. Anywhere you</p>
<p begin="01:18:30.783" end="01:18:34.423" style="s2">want. Use my husband&#39;s card.</p>
<p begin="01:18:32.663" end="01:18:35.583" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really? President Ethan.</p>
<p begin="01:18:34.423" end="01:18:37.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go wild.</p>
<p begin="01:18:35.583" end="01:18:40.023" style="s2">Relax. The card is Serena&#39;s and mine.</p>
<p begin="01:18:37.823" end="01:18:42.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena and Ethan are a perfect match,</p>
<p begin="01:18:40.023" end="01:18:44.943" style="s2">made in heaven. Next to those two,</p>
<p begin="01:18:42.223" end="01:18:46.663" style="s2">Samantha and Zach don&#39;t even compare.</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.943" end="01:18:47.703" style="s2">Did you guys hear? They&#39;re both</p>
<p begin="01:18:46.663" end="01:18:50.423" style="s2">miserable now.</p>
<p begin="01:18:47.703" end="01:18:51.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really? We&#39;re worlds apart now, so I</p>
<p begin="01:18:50.423" end="01:18:54.223" style="s2">haven&#39;t kept up with them.</p>
<p begin="01:18:51.663" end="01:18:56.623" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hear Zach hauls bricks at a job site,</p>
<p begin="01:18:54.223" end="01:18:58.863" style="s2">working himself raw for peanuts.</p>
<p begin="01:18:56.623" end="01:19:00.583" style="s2">It all goes to Samantha&#39;s care.</p>
<p begin="01:18:58.863" end="01:19:03.103" style="s2">She acts up daily and treats him like a</p>
<p begin="01:19:00.583" end="01:19:04.863" style="s2">slave. They did this to themselves.</p>
<p begin="01:19:03.103" end="01:19:07.183" style="s2">It&#39;s all their own fault.</p>
<p begin="01:19:04.863" end="01:19:08.343" style="s2">One&#39;s greedy, one&#39;s selfish.</p>
<p begin="01:19:07.183" end="01:19:10.383" style="s2">How could that ever end well?</p>
<p begin="01:19:08.343" end="01:19:12.783" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re doomed to torment each other for</p>
<p begin="01:19:10.383" end="01:19:14.303" style="s2">life. If only they&#39;d known that.</p>
<p begin="01:19:12.783" end="01:19:16.183" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough about them.</p>
<p begin="01:19:14.303" end="01:19:17.983" style="s2">We&#39;re going abroad soon.</p>
<p begin="01:19:16.183" end="01:19:20.543" style="s2">Whatever you want to do, I&#39;m with you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:17.983" end="01:19:22.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s enjoy a nice meal.</p>
<p begin="01:19:20.543" end="01:19:24.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:19:22.263" end="01:19:26.183" style="s2">Here&#39;s to Serena and President Ethan.</p>
<p begin="01:19:24.743" end="01:19:28.623" style="s2">May they have a baby soon and live in</p>
<p begin="01:19:26.183" end="01:19:28.623" style="s2">bliss.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
